d TV series in 1987", "context_len": 18}}}, "wrote": {"freq": 441, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 441, "word_index": 1, "context": "He wrote the screenplays for 37 movies he directed , many of which are today known as classics such as ; `` The Maltese Falcon '' ( 1941 ) , `` The Treasure of the Sierra Madre '' ( 1948 ) , `` Key Largo '' ( 1948 ) , `` The Asphalt Jungle '' ( 1950 ) , `` The African Queen '' ( 1951 ) , `` Moulin Rouge '' ( 1952 ) , `` The Misfits '' ( 1961 ) , and `` The Man Who Would Be King '' ( 1975 )", "context_len": 96}}}, "famine": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 18, "context": "6 November 1985 : [ Davis 's ] designs shown during `` Fashion Aid '' benefit for Ethiopian famine relief at Palladium Discotheque [ 126 E", "context_len": 26}}}, "followed": {"freq": 130, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 130, "word_index": 37, "context": "`` Leisem Jagoi `` ( ) ( literally , `` Dance of creation of the earth '' ) is a dance form enacted by imitating the movements of nine gods and seven goddesses creating the earth , followed by Laibou Jagoi , depicting the creation of human body and various activities of man , like weaving of clothes", "context_len": 58}}}, "attempt": {"freq": 57, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 52, "word_index": 40, "context": "It began after President Trump and his personal attorney Rudy Giuliani repeatedly wanted the Ukrainian government to investigate Hunter Biden , the son of former vice president and 2020 presidential candidate Joe Biden , in what was seen as an attempt to hurt Biden 's candidacy for president and for Trump to gain advantages in the 2020 election", "context_len": 58}, "VERB": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 6, "context": "In Capture the Flag , players attempt to bring the objective from the enemy base to their own while preventing the enemy from the doing the same", "context_len": 27}}}, "save": {"freq": 67, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 64, "word_index": 13, "context": "`` The first line of the first and second verse 