according to the agreements , by the end of 2019", "context_len": 74}}}, "announcement": {"freq": 22, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 22, "word_index": 37, "context": "In late 2008 through early 2009 , WWE Tag Team Champions The Col\u00f3ns ( Carlito and Primo ) started a rivalry with the World Tag Team Champions John Morrison and The Miz , which resulted in the announcement on the March 17 edition of `` ECW '' that at WrestleMania XXV both teams would fight for their titles against each other and the winning team would hold both titles", "context_len": 69}}}, "inventory": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 5, "context": "The Tentative List is an inventory of important heritage and natural sites that a country is considering for inscription on the World Heritage List , thereby becoming World Heritage Sites", "context_len": 30}}}, "sale": {"freq": 46, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 46, "word_index": 0, "context": "Sale grew up in Cayuga Heights , Ithaca , New York , and would later say of the village that he `` spent most of my first twenty years there , and that has made an imprint on me\u2013on my philosophy , social attitudes , certainly on my politics\u2013that has lasted powerfully for the rest of my life", "context_len": 58}}}, "going": {"freq": 135, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 135, "word_index": 33, "context": "`` When it came to doing things that felt very much like older Linkin Park , like mixing hip-hop with a rock chorus , [ we ] felt like , if we were going to do it , we need to really do it in a way that felt natural and felt original and felt like it was something we had n't done in the past , '' said Chester Bennington in an interview with MTV News who referred to Linkin Park 's new style as less technical and more organic : `` [ While ] there are hip-hop songs on the album - 'Wretches and Kings ' , 'When They Come for Me ' they 're like nothing the band have tried before : snarling , raw", "context_len": 128}}}, "business": {"freq": 180, "POS