ollege Championship uses a ten-game format similar to that used for the Tournament of Champions and the Teen Tournament : 15 players , in groups of three , play in five quarterfinal games ; the winners of those five games and the four highest-scoring nonwinners as wild cards become the nine semifinalists who compete in three games , with no two players rematching each other in the semifinal round", "context_len": 70}, "VERB": {"freq": 237, "word_index": 30, "context": "Slezak mostly played villains or thugs , most notably the German U-boat captain in Alfred Hitchcock 's movie `` Lifeboat '' ( 1944 ) , but occasionally he got to play lighter roles , as in `` The Wonderful World '' of the `` Brothers Grimm '' ( 1962 )", "context_len": 50}}}, "goes": {"freq": 126, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 126, "word_index": 41, "context": "Taoists believe that the `` myriad things '' , or everything in the universe from animals to materials to ideas , originally came from the Tao , and when something disappears , it 's energy ( or `` qi '' ) goes back to the Tao to be absorbed and re-birthed in a different form", "context_len": 55}}}, "though": {"freq": 220, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 219, "word_index": 88, "context": "of Saint Sophia until the Fall of Constantinople ) , in Istanbul and in 1832 the Russian Architectural Renaissance would be approved , in the place a old Convent and Church and the first stone would be laid until 1839 , the interior would be painted by the best Russian painters of the time and the scaffolding would not be removed until 1860 , and the dome would be placed using the Electroplating technique , and in 1882 Tchaikovsky would premiere the `` 1812 Overture '' , even though the cathedral was half finished , it would finally be consecrated on May 26 , 1883 , one day after the coronation of Alexander III , its interior had paintings of Russian saints and the Napoleonic withdrawal from Moscow", "context_len": 128}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context":