dex": 13, "context": "Many unusually interesting actions are happened , especially the flying techniques ( jumping kick , knee strike and with elbow in flying ) , and techniques in walking of stairs ( kicks and knee strike )", "context_len": 36}}}, "house": {"freq": 254, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 254, "word_index": 86, "context": "Macartney , and sees him with guns in his hands , saying , `` O God ! -- forgive me ! '' Thinking he is trying to kill himself , she stops him and cries , `` O Sir ! have mercy upon yourself ! '' She later finds out he had been planning to rob people by frightening them with his guns for money , because the Branghtons had threatened to put him in prison if he did n't pay money to stay at their house", "context_len": 87}}}, "fail": {"freq": 22, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 18, "word_index": 41, "context": "A `` threshold exceeded '' value is intended to indicate that there is a relatively high probability that the drive will not be able to honour its specification in the future \u2013 that is , the drive is `` about to fail ''", "context_len": 43}, "NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 7, "context": "Chaudhary 's attempts to bribe a judge fail , and his immediate bail request is denied", "context_len": 16}, "UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 3, "context": "A failure ( fail , or flop ) is where a goal or mission is not completed", "context_len": 17}}}, "blocking": {"freq": 14, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 13, "word_index": 20, "context": "According to them , Bishesh was driving dead drunk and was even not able to reverse her car which was blocking the minister \u2019 s security escorts", "context_len": 27}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 20, "context": "uBlock Origin ( `` you-block '' ) is a free and open-source browser extension for filtering content , including ad blocking", "context_len": 21}}}, "move": {"freq": 174, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 135, "word_index": 34, "context": "`` He went on to say , `` If you want to leave a nation you think is 