x": 2, "context": "He wrote essays , too , for example `` Bom Senso e Bom Gosto '' ( `` Good Sense and Good Taste '' )", "context_len": 24}}}, "autobiographical": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 4, "context": "Further theatre pieces and autobiographical pieces include `` Histoire de ma vie '' ( 1855 ) , `` Elle et Lui '' ( 1859 ) ( about her affair with Musset ) , `` Journal Intime '' ( posthumously published in 1926 ) , and `` Correspondence ''", "context_len": 48}}}, "aphorisms": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "A poet , Kunert also wrote short stories , essays , autobiographical works , aphorisms , satires , fairy tales , science fiction , radio plays , speeches , travel writing , movie scripts , a novel , and a drama", "context_len": 41}}}, "satires": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 16, "context": "A poet , Kunert also wrote short stories , essays , autobiographical works , aphorisms , satires , fairy tales , science fiction , radio plays , speeches , travel writing , movie scripts , a novel , and a drama", "context_len": 41}}}, "fairy": {"freq": 10, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 33, "context": "In this episode of the series , the small dragon also meets a number of new allies , including the Professor , Hunter the cheetah , Elora the fawn , and Zoe the fairy , and must face Ripto and his henchmen , Crush and Gulp , two other dinosaurs who are not very smart", "context_len": 55}, "UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 22, "context": "The Red Shoes is a 1948 British musical drama movie directed by Michael Powell and Emeric Pressburger and was based on the fairy tale of the same name by Hans Christian Andersen", "context_len": 32}}}, "tales": {"freq": 11, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 11, "word_index": 22, "context": "Despite the historical context , with the usage of the title `` Pakhangba '' , he was often deified with various mythological tales , revolving around his identity as a human incarnation of God Pakhangba ( frequently mentioned in the alias `` Konjil Tuthokpa '' )", "context_len": 46}}}, "science": {"freq": 134, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 130, "word_index": 23, "context": "There were notable appearances from Rik Mayall , playing Lord Flashheart in `` Bells '' , two figures famous for their roles in science fiction series - Tom Baker and Simon Jones - in `` Potato '' , Miriam Margolyes , as the puritanical Lady Whiteadder , and Hugh Laurie appearing twice , first as the drunken Simon Partridge in `` Beer '' and in the final episode as the evil Prince Ludwig", "context_len": 73}, "UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 17, "context": "As they get into what seem like normal domestic crises that usually escalate in surreal , often science fiction-esque , ways", "context_len": 21}, "VERB": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 93, "context": "Professor Hans Eysenck of London University 's Institute of Psychiatry stated `` Unless there is a gigantic conspiracy involving some thirty university departments all over the world , and several hundred highly respected scientists in various fields , many of them originally skeptical to the claims of the psychical researchers , the only conclusion that the unbiased observer can come to is that there does exist a small number of people who obtain knowledge existing in other people 's minds , or in the outer world , by means as yet unknown to science ''", "context_len": 95}}}, "fiction": {"freq": 73, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 73, "word_index": 24, "context": "There were notable appearances from Rik Mayall , playing Lord Flashheart in `` Bells '' , two figures famous for their roles in science fiction series - Tom Baker and Simon Jones - in `` Potato '' , Miriam Margolyes , as the puritanical Lady Whiteadder , and Hugh Laurie appearing twice , first as the drunken Simon Partridge in `` Beer '' and in the final episode as the evil Prince Ludwig", "context_len": 73}}}, "radio": {"freq": 217, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 206, "word_index": 17, "context": "At 09:28:17 , eleven seconds into the descent , Cleveland heard a man scream into the cockpit radio : `` Mayday ! Mayday ! Mayday ! '' A second raspy shout went , `` Hey ! Get out of here ! '' Cleveland Air Traffic Controller John Werth did n't know the source of the call he heard , and could only make out what he heard as `` just some gruttural , gruttural sounds", "context_len": 75}, "VERB": {"freq": 9, "word_index": 38, "context": "This started to become a moot point by 1972 , as most major record labels solidified a trend they had started in the 1960s by putting the same song on both sides of the singles it serviced to radio", "context_len": 39}, "UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 8, "context": "Over time , Garroway hosted a series of radio programs such as `` The 11:60 Club '' , `` The Dave Garroway Show '' , and `` Reserved for Garroway ''", "context_len": 31}}}, "plays": {"freq": 217, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 52, "word_index": 44, "context": "His circle of associates , friends and lovers included Pablo Picasso , Jean Hugo , Jean Marais , Henri Bernstein , Marlene Dietrich , Coco Chanel , Erik Satie , Mar\u00eda F\u00e9lix , \u00c9dith Piaf ( whom he cast in one of his one-act plays entitled `` Le Bel Indifferent '' in 1940 ) , and Raymond Radiguet", "context_len": 58}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 165, "word_index": 7, "context": "In lacrosse , the men 's team plays in ECAC Lacrosse and the women 's team in the American Lacrosse Conference , but both will leave their respective leagues after the 2014 season , as the Big Ten will start lacrosse leagues for both sexes in the 2014\u201315 school year", "context_len": 50}}}, "speeches": {"freq": 20, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 20, "word_index": 27, "context": "A poet , Kunert also wrote short stories , essays , autobiographical works , aphorisms , satires , fairy tales , science fiction , radio plays , speeches , travel writing , movie scripts , a novel , and a drama", "context_len": 41}}}, "travel": {"freq": 80, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 33, "word_index": 14, "context": "Her prize package includes cash , a year contract promoting Miss Universe , world travel , a rent-free prestigious New York City apartment , a luxury apartment , and a gift bag stuffed with designer shoes , dresses and beauty products , a US $ 100,000 stipend for a two-year course at the New York Film Academy and free access to famous fashion houses and beauty parlors", "context_len": 67}, "VERB": {"freq": 47, "word_index": 18, "context": "He has since returned to the United Kingdom where the British Government has decided that he ca n't travel overseas and several countries around the world have banned him and he gave in his passport to the government officials as required", "context_len": 41}}}, "writing": {"freq": 153, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 39, "word_index": 30, "context": "A poet , Kunert also wrote short stories , essays , autobiographical works , aphorisms , satires , fairy tales , science fiction , radio plays , speeches , travel writing , movie scripts , a novel , and a drama", "context_len": 41}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "In the 1970s , he was a writing lecturer at the University of Texas at Austin", "context_len": 16}, "VERB_PresC": {"freq": 113, "word_index": 26, "context": "He `` has been a regular contributor to progressive magazines like `` Mother Jones '' and `` The Nation '' for the better part of his writing career , '' and has continued to write for those publications , as well as for `` The American Conservative '' , `` CounterPunch '' , `` The New York Review of Books '' , and the `` Utne Reader ''", "context_len": 68}}}, "scripts": {"freq": 20, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 20, "word_index": 33, "context": "A poet , Kunert also wrote short stories , essays , autobiographical works , aphorisms , satires , fairy tales , science fiction , radio plays , speeches , travel writing , movie scripts , a novel , and a drama", "context_len": 41}}}, "novel": {"freq": 153, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 122, "word_index": 20, "context": "With Ken 's help in some of the programming , Roberta designed `` Mystery House '' , inspired by the novel `` And Then There Were None '' and the board game `` Clue '' , using text commands and printout combined with graphics depicting the current setting", "context_len": 48}, "UNK": {"freq": 30, "word_index": 1, "context": "His novel `` Baby-foot '' , published in 1977 , follows on from `` Un sac de billes '' and describes his life in Paris following World War II and his discovery of American values", "context_len": 35}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "Wells novel `` The War of the Worlds ''", "context_len": 9}}}, "drama": {"freq": 277, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 274, "word_index": 69, "context": "Circle of Love '' ( 1964 ) , `` The Man , the Woman and the Money '' ( 1965 ) , `` The Incredible Army of Brancaleone '' ( 1966 ) , `` Adultery Italian Style '' ( 1966 ) , `` Hotel '' ( 1967 ) , `` The Libertine '' ( 1969 ) , `` Diary of a Telephone Operator '' ( 1969 ) , the drama `` The Cat o ' Nine Tails '' ( 1971 ) , `` Story of a Cloistered Nun '' ( 1973 ) , `` My Darling Slave '' ( 1973 ) , `` Take a Hard Ride '' ( 1975 ) , `` Sunday Lovers '' ( 1980 ) and `` Miele di donna '' ( 1981 )", "context_len": 128}, "VERB": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 9, "context": "In February 2011 , YangZi starred in the family drama `` Love Comes Knocking on the Door '' , based on the novel `` Stepmother '' by Geling Yan", "context_len": 29}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "Often thought of as primarily a director of comedies , he also directed drama movies such as ; `` Breakfast at Tiffany 's '' and `` Days of Wine and Roses ''", "context_len": 32}}}, "lecturer": {"freq": 18, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 18, "word_index": 15, "context": "He was also a professor at Complutense , URJC and ESADE Universities and an academic lecturer at Harvard , Georgetown ( United States ) , Andr\u00e9s Bello ( Caracas , Venezuela ) and Antonio Ruiz de Montoya ( Lima , Peru ) universities", "context_len": 43}}}, "honorary": {"freq": 25, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 24, "word_index": 21, "context": "On November 28 , 2020 , during the 2nd Lavat Awards ceremony held in Mexico City , Diana Santos received an honorary award in recognition for her lifetime work as a dubbing actress spanning 64 years", "context_len": 36}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "The Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences ( AMPAS ) is a professional honorary group meant for the advancement of the arts and sciences of movies", "context_len": 27}}}, "doctor": {"freq": 51, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 51, "word_index": 18, "context": "Herbert Benson ( April 24 , 1935 \u2013 February 3 , 2022 ) , was an American medical doctor , cardiologist , and founder of the Mind Body Medical Institute at Massachusetts General Hospital ( MGH )", "context_len": 37}}}, "several": {"freq": 642, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 642, "word_index": 29, "context": "Professor Hans Eysenck of London University 's Institute of Psychiatry stated `` Unless there is a gigantic conspiracy involving some thirty university departments all over the world , and several hundred highly respected scientists in various fields , many of them originally skeptical to the claims of the psychical researchers , the only conclusion that the unbiased observer can come to is that there does exist a small number of people who obtain knowledge existing in other people 's minds , or in the outer world , by means as yet unknown to science ''", "context_len": 95}}}, "universities": {"freq": 92, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 92, "word_index": 30, "context": "His family was illustrious and noble ; after the usual education of a boy in grammar and elementary classical studies , his father , Piero , sent him to the universities of Ferrara and Padua , where he stayed until the year 1505", "context_len": 43}}}, "awarded": {"freq": 137, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 137, "word_index": 18, "context": "In 1960 IWT ( Indus Waters Treaty ) was signed ; according to this treaty , India was awarded rights to the Sutlej , Beas , and Ravi rivers , and Pakistan besides the waters of these three rivers within Pakistani territories , and some financial compensation was granted rights to construct the Indus , Chenab , and Jhelum river basins", "context_len": 61}}}, "documentary": {"freq": 55, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 34, "word_index": 9, "context": "In 2013 , Boggs was featured in a PBS documentary `` American Revolutionary : The Evolution of Grace Lee Boggs '' , which focused on her political views , actions , and steps she took to make a difference in the community and in the world", "context_len": 46}, "UNK": {"freq": 21, "word_index": 53, "context": "At the same time he did `` Today '' , Garroway also hosted a Friday night variety series , `` The Dave Garroway Show '' , from October 2 , 1953 , to June 25 , 1954 , and on October 16 , 1955 , he began hosting NBC 's Sunday afternoon live documentary `` Wide Wide World '' , continuing with that series until June 8 , 1958", "context_len": 69}}}, "attacks": {"freq": 129, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 121, "word_index": 15, "context": "It is likely that because the pilots had been warned of the World Trade Center attacks and to beware of cockpit intrusion , when the hijackers attacked them , they purposely pressed on the talk button of the radio microphone , so sounds of the struggle in the cockpit will be heard by FAA ground controllers and by pilots of planes on the same radio frequency", "context_len": 66}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 11, "context": "Things do n't look good for Mickey and Pluto after he attacks the judge ( due to him being rude to Pluto ) , resulting in the two getting kicked out", "context_len": 31}}}, "planes": {"freq": 22, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 22, "word_index": 60, "context": "It is likely that because the pilots had been warned of the World Trade Center attacks and to beware of cockpit intrusion , when the hijackers attacked them , they purposely pressed on the talk button of the radio microphone , so sounds of the struggle in the cockpit will be heard by FAA ground controllers and by pilots of planes on the same radio frequency", "context_len": 66}}}, "crashed": {"freq": 34, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 34, "word_index": 5, "context": "United Airlines Flight 232 had crashed on 19 July 1989 while attempting an emergency landing in Sioux City , Iowa with 111 of the 296 people on board losing their lives", "context_len": 31}}}, "buildings": {"freq": 151, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 151, "word_index": 8, "context": "The name comes from the fact that the buildings having the Executive , represented by the Pal\u00e1cio do Planalto ( presidential office ) ; the Legislative represented by the Congresso Nacional ( National Congress ) ; and the Judiciary , represented by the Supremo Tribunal Federal ( Supreme Federal Court ) are in this plaza", "context_len": 55}}}, "occurring": {"freq": 15, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 14, "word_index": 7, "context": "The species cover a vast area , occurring through Africa , the Indian Subcontinent , to China , down Southeast Asia to Brunei , Indonesia , the Philippines , New Guinea , Australia and islands of the Indian Ocean , and the South China Sea", "context_len": 45}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "0 days of precipitation , with the most precipitation occurring in September with 7", "context_len": 14}}}, "chemical": {"freq": 229, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 205, "word_index": 44, "context": "When the double layer capacitance idea is used to create a device , they are sometimes called `` ultracapacitors '' because they store energy by separating the charges ( like a capacitor but capable of storing more energy ) , instead of using a chemical reaction to store electricity", "context_len": 49}, "UNK": {"freq": 24, "word_index": 16, "context": "Many Arab and Western countries , including the United States provided weapons ( including biological and chemical weapons of mass destruction ) and technical support for Iraq 's Saddam Hussein", "context_len": 30}}}, "compound": {"freq": 111, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 109, "word_index": 4, "context": "The word is a compound word , and said by Richard Lederer in his book `` Crazy English '' to be made up of these words : super- `` above '' , cali- `` beauty '' , fragilistic- `` delicate '' , expiali- `` to atone '' , and -docious `` educable '' , with all of these parts combined meaning `` Atoning for educability through delicate beauty", "context_len": 68}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Compared with simple eyes , compound eyes possess a wide-angle view", "context_len": 11}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "Almost all insects and arachnids use both simple and compound eyes", "context_len": 11}}}, "alkene": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "Butene is the third occurring chemical compound in the alkene series of compounds", "context_len": 13}}}, "compounds": {"freq": 56, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 52, "word_index": 24, "context": "The reactions needed to feed and reproduce bacteria and fungi increase at higher temperatures , up to the point that the proteins and other compounds in their cells themselves begin to breakdown , or denature , so quickly that they can not be replaced", "context_len": 44}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 18, "context": "Examples are the words `` one '' , `` two '' , `` three '' , and also compounds like `` three hundred and forty-two '' ( Commonwealth English ) or `` three hundred forty-two '' ( American English )", "context_len": 40}}}, "formula": {"freq": 111, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 110, "word_index": 42, "context": "Since the Hot 100 was based on singles sales , as singles have themselves become a less common form of song release , the Hot 100 's data represented a narrowing segment of sales until the December 1998 change in the ranking formula", "context_len": 43}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Formula Two ( 1980\u20131984 )", "context_len": 5}}}, "laboratories": {"freq": 16, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 15, "word_index": 14, "context": "The Hanson Hall of Science 's facilities and resources include seven classrooms , thirty-five laboratories ( including a cadaver lab ) , a 400 MHz liquid-and solid-state NMR ( nuclear magnetic resonance ) spectrometer , scanning electron microscope , instrumentation for X-ray powder crystallography and a 40-foot greenhouse", "context_len": 48}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "In Brazil , laboratories use sugarcane juice to make ethanol fuel", "context_len": 11}}}, "formed": {"freq": 294, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 294, "word_index": 64, "context": "Upon Ymir 's defeat , the three brother 's crafted the Earth and Heavens from his body , the oceans from his sweat , ( some cases from his blood ) the trees were crafted from his hair , his eyebrows were used to make Midgard ( one of the nine worlds ) , his bones made the mountains , his skull is what formed the sky , and from his brains they created the clouds", "context_len": 76}}}, "covalent": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "Butane is formed from covalent bonds between hydrogen and carbon atoms", "context_len": 11}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "Molecular covalent bonds can be described as polar or nonpolar", "context_len": 10}}}, "bonds": {"freq": 15, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 15, "word_index": 6, "context": "Rubber products also degrade as sulphur bonds induced during vulcanization revert ; this is why old rubber bands and other rubber products soften and get sticky as they age", "context_len": 29}}}, "hydrogen": {"freq": 53, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 51, "word_index": 20, "context": "It can be made several ways : reduction of potassium permanganate with potassium sulfite ; reduction of potassium manganate with hydrogen peroxide and potassium hydroxide ; and disproportionation when manganese dioxide is dissolved in potassium hydroxide", "context_len": 36}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "( It is similar to hydrogen azide , which is the gas form", "context_len": 13}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "Hydrazoic acid is hydrogen azide dissolved in water", "context_len": 8}}}, "carbon": {"freq": 71, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 65, "word_index": 35, "context": "Organic foods are unique to the way other products are produced as chemically treated food can cause a lot of harm to the environment by decreasing the quality of soil and increasing energy use , carbon emissions , pesticides , and nitrate pollution", "context_len": 43}, "UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 9, "context": "The fill from two of the stoneholes has been carbon dated to between 2900 and 2600 BC ( 3870 -90 , 4130 -90 )", "context_len": 24}, "VERB": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 40, "context": "Didgeridoos can also be made from PVC pipes , non-native hard woods ( which are split , hollowed and rejoined ) , fiberglass , metal , agave , clay , hemp ( a bioplastic named zelfo ) , and even carbon fiber", "context_len": 42}}}, "atoms": {"freq": 27, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 27, "word_index": 41, "context": "It is sometimes called feynmanium ( symbol Fy ) because Richard Feynman noted that a simplistic interpretation of the relativistic Dirac equation runs into problems with electron orbitals at `` Z '' & gt ; 1 137 , suggesting that neutral atoms can not exist beyond untriseptium , and that a periodic table of elements based on electron orbitals breaks down at this point", "context_len": 64}}}, "isomers": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "There are four isomers , and all are gases at room temperature", "context_len": 12}}}, "gases": {"freq": 20, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 19, "word_index": 15, "context": "Shelf life can be changed by many things : exposure to light , heat , gases ( including humidity ) , mechanical stresses , and contamination by things such as micro-organisms", "context_len": 31}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "Lab studies tell which gases react with each other and how fast they react", "context_len": 14}}}, "room": {"freq": 61, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 61, "word_index": 46, "context": "Filming locations included Ranger 's House in Greenwich ( standing in for the Bridgerton House exterior ) ; Halton House at RAF Halton ( Bridgerton House interior , Featheringtons ' interior ) ; Wilton House ( Simon 's Hastings House , Clyvedon estate interior , throne room ) ; Syon House and Badminton House ( Hastings House ) ; Castle Howard ( Clyvedon estate ) ; Coneysthorpe ( Clyvedon village ) ; Hampton Court Palace and Lancaster House ( St", "context_len": 80}}}, "temperature": {"freq": 111, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 110, "word_index": 29, "context": "Solid mechanics is the branch of mechanics , physics , and mathematics that concerns itself with how solid matter under external actions works ( such as external forces , temperature changes , applied displacements , etc", "context_len": 36}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": null, "context": null, "context_len": 0}}}, "hydrocarbons": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "All four of these hydrocarbons have four carbon atoms and one double bond in their molecules , but have different chemical structures", "context_len": 22}}}, "double": {"freq": 65, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 47, "word_index": 61, "context": "[ citation needed ] Another good example of a ripoff is `` Genshin Impact '' , which is widely seen as a ripoff of `` '' , others are animated rip-offs of numerous TV shows like the English-dubbed Bob Boyle and Cam Clarke 's `` Nutri Ventures '' in 2013 and `` Kid Cosmic '' in 2021 , is as a double ripoff of original `` The Powerpuff Girls '' and `` Coconut Fred '' is a rip-off of `` SpongeBob SquarePants ''", "context_len": 83}, "VERB": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 18, "context": "At present it is slightly slower than the final parallel SCSI implementation , but in 2009 it will double its present speed to 6 Gbit s", "context_len": 26}, "NOUN": {"freq": 13, "word_index": 44, "context": "After being subject to admonished at Eaton [ while preparing to give a profane oath at a drinking party ] and his honor destroyed at Oxford [ where he is exposed at trying to cheat at cards ] , William is haunted by his double in subsequent years , who thwarts plans described by William as driven by ambition [ in Rome ] , revenge [ in Paris ] , passionate Love [ in Naples ] , and avarice [ In Egypt ] and even follows him to other cities [ Vienna , Berlin , Moscow ]", "context_len": 97}}}, "bond": {"freq": 11, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 11, "word_index": 34, "context": "At the same time , OU developed a separate legislative proposal ( the `` New Partnership '' ) to start a separate 15-person board of trustees for OU and a $ 800 million state bond issue to match private donations to a new OU endowment fund", "context_len": 46}}}, "molecules": {"freq": 62, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 59, "word_index": 29, "context": "In a dielectric the above contribution to displacement current is also present , but a major contribution to the displacement current is related to the polarization of the individual molecules of the dielectric material", "context_len": 34}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 9, "context": "It can be made by bonding two nitrogen dioxide molecules together at a low temperature or a high pressure", "context_len": 19}}}, "different": {"freq": 749, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 749, "word_index": 4, "context": "Among his collaborations in different genres of music like jazz , pop , funk , soul , we can find great names such as Mina ( the most famous Italian pop singer ) , Gerry Mulligan , \u00c1stor Piazzolla ( the bassline in the famous composition `` Libertango '' belongs to him ) , Quincy Jones , Wilson Pickett , Shirley Bassey , Maynard Ferguson , Franco Cerri , St\u00e9phane Grappelli , Aldemaro Romero and many others", "context_len": 77}}}, "structures": {"freq": 42, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 40, "word_index": 44, "context": "Critics of the rule say that it imposes unreasonable constraints on the ability of communities to govern themselves and so undermines democracy , and even that local self-government is a matter of natural right that does not need to be conferred by higher political structures", "context_len": 45}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 1, "context": "Ocala structures on the National Register of Historic Places include the Coca Cola Building , the E", "context_len": 17}}}, "respectively": {"freq": 35, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 35, "word_index": 59, "context": "The longest-running cast members were Philip Martin Brown ( Grantly Budgen ) , Jason Done ( Tom Clarkson ) , Chelsee Healey ( Janeece Bryant ) and Denise Welch ( Steph Haydock ) , who appeared from series 1 until their exits in series 9 for Brown , 8 for Done and Healey , and 6 for Welch , respectively", "context_len": 60}}}, "character": {"freq": 321, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 320, "word_index": 22, "context": "He has been the speaking voice of Bumblebee since the final episode of `` Transformers : Prime '' and has voiced the character in the movie `` Transformers Prime Beast Hunters : Predacons Rising '' and in the stand-alone sequel `` Transformers : Robots in Disguise '' , as well as in `` Transformers : Rescue Bots ''", "context_len": 58}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "There were several character inventions in the sketches", "context_len": 8}}}, "presidency": {"freq": 50, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 50, "word_index": 2, "context": "Under his presidency at United Artists , the company won the Academy Award for Best Picture three years in a row : `` One Flew Over the Cuckoo 's Nest '' ( 1975 ) , `` Rocky '' ( 1976 ) and `` Annie Hall '' ( 1977 )", "context_len": 49}}}, "tenure": {"freq": 12, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 12, "word_index": 2, "context": "During his tenure , Teuku Iskandar asked by the Malaysia 's linguistic council to copied the `` Bahasa Indonesia dan Pembakuannya '' ( ) and `` Kamus Besar Bahasa Indonesia '' ( ) who were developed by Raja Ali Haji ( an Indonesian Bugis scholar ) since 19th century and Anton Moeliono in 1969 to re-branded and claimed it as the `` Kamus Dewan '' ( ) that published in 1970 and designated as the main linguistic reference for the Malay language in the region ( which later also known as Malaysian Malay )", "context_len": 94}}}, "longest": {"freq": 80, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 80, "word_index": 46, "context": "Later they were also used to say the exact time of holy days of pre-Islamic religions , such as telling the time of the equal day and night ( `` Nowruz ) '' , `` Chelah '' , or `` Yald\u0101 '' \u2013 the shortest , longest , and equal-length days and nights of the years", "context_len": 56}}}, "candidacy": {"freq": 35, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 35, "word_index": 45, "context": "It began after President Trump and his personal attorney Rudy Giuliani repeatedly wanted the Ukrainian government to investigate Hunter Biden , the son of former vice president and 2020 presidential candidate Joe Biden , in what was seen as an attempt to hurt Biden 's candidacy for president and for Trump to gain advantages in the 2020 election", "context_len": 58}}}, "election": {"freq": 488, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 488, "word_index": 19, "context": "On 8 January 2023 , after the victory of Luiz In\u00e1cio Lula da Silva in the 2022 Brazilian general election , supporters of the former president , Jair Bolsonaro , attacked the Supreme Court of Brazil , the National Congress of Brazil and the Planalto Presidential Palace in the Pra\u00e7a dos Tr\u00eas Poderes plaza in Bras\u00edlia , the federal capital", "context_len": 60}}}, "beati