tion for this fortress after one of his spiritual advisors showed that the site had good potential and was good as a government building", "context_len": 30}}}, "routes": {"freq": 39, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 39, "word_index": 67, "context": "During the reign of Queen Hatshepsut in the 15th century BC , ships regularly crossed the Red Sea in order to get bitumen , copper , carved amulets , naptha and other goods transported overland and down the Dead Sea to Elat at the head of the gulf of Aqaba where they were joined with frankincense and myrrh coming north both by sea and overland along trade routes through the mountains running north along the east coast of the Red Sea", "context_len": 81}}}, "ranging": {"freq": 19, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 19, "word_index": 15, "context": "It was not unusual for the group to play entire sets of cover versions , ranging anywhere from Bryan Adams 's `` Summer of '69 '' to Dusty Springfield 's `` The Look of Love '' to Led Zeppelin 's `` Black Dog", "context_len": 43}}}, "submitted": {"freq": 16, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 16, "word_index": 12, "context": "Both declined the offer to run for Party Leader and instead Contreras submitted his Nomination to run for Second Deputy Leader of the UDP and so the Party had no other option but to elect Barrow as their Leader", "context_len": 39}}}, "twelve": {"freq": 50, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 25, "word_index": 37, "context": "At 09:27:25 , as the aircraft was crossing into eastern Ohio airspace , the flight crew responded to a routine radio call from a Cleveland air traffic controller , who told them to watch for another plane twelve miles away and two thousand feet above them", "context_len": 46}, "UNK": {"freq": 17, "word_index": 16, "context": "`` What difference does it make if an elephant is seven feet high or eleven or twelve feet high ? An elephant is an elephant ! '' he said", "context_len": 29}, "VERB": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 35, "context": "For example : People listening to the forecast who know the protocol can understand it as `` In the English Channel , there are strong winds , followed by a stronger wind in less than twelve hours time with some light rain , but good visibility ''", "context_len": 47}}}, "volume": {"freq": 40, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 40, "word_index": 31, "context": "In March 2005 , measurements by the Solar Wind Anisotropies ( SWAN ) instrument onboard the Solar and Heliospheric Observatory ( SOHO ) showed that the heliosphere , the solar wind-filled volume which prevents the solar system from becoming embedded in the local ( ambient ) interstellar medium , is not axisymmetrical , but is distorted , very likely under the effect of the local galactic magnetic field", "context_len": 68}}}, "upon": {"freq": 97, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 96, "word_index": 42, "context": "Macartney , and sees him with guns in his hands , saying , `` O God ! -- forgive me ! '' Thinking he is trying to kill himself , she stops him and cries , `` O Sir ! have mercy upon yourself ! '' She later finds out he had been planning to rob people by frightening them with his guns for money , because the Branghtons had threatened to put him in prison if he did n't pay money to stay at their house", "context_len": 87}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 18, "context": "The Navy pays for the Midshipmen 's college expenses in exchange for the students serving in the military upon graduation", "context_len": 20}}}, "financial": {"freq": 82, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 82, "word_index": 14, "context": "`` Taxi '' ( November 1986 ) commented that being young and having no financial backing did not intimidate Davis from creating couture clothing of the highest level ; that respect should be paid to him and fashion magazine should acknowledge him and take the initiative to put him on the map ; and also that a lady dressed in Davis \u2019 s clothes would not only be taken seriously , but would be praised for her good taste and silent elegance - daring to detach herself from the uniforms of a working machine", "context_len": 94}}}, "support": {"freq": 248, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 162, "word_index": 13, "context": "The reception for Nokia N90 has been for children in Nokia N90 , support partner is Wall Street Journal wrote on May 17 , 2005 , they choice wrote this `` We have make sure for Nokia N90 '' , Nokia N90 has announced for Nokia Connecting Peoples developed for flip camera , Nokia N90 has smillar for Nokia 6300 partner for Menu options and more , Nokia N90 can wrote choice by photo during taken , in June 2010 , Nokia N90 available desgin from features", "context_len": 87}, "VERB": {"freq": 85, "word_index": 16, "context": "In November 2019 , Peebles noted , in his award presentation , that he does not support the Big Bang Theory , due to the lack of concrete supporting evidence , and stated , `` It 's very unfortunate that one thinks of the beginning whereas in fact , we have no good theory of such a thing as the beginning", "context_len": 61}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 44, "context": "There are a number of full-time postgraduate research students based on the 48 hectare university campus where they use the OU facilities for research , as well as more than 1000 members of academic and research staff and over 2500 administrative , operational and support staff", "context_len": 46}}}, "secession": {"freq": 28, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 28, "word_index": 51, "context": "`` He went on to say , `` If you want to leave a nation you think is corrupt , inefficient , militaristic , oppressive , repressive , but you do n't want to move to Canada or France , what do you do ? Well , the way is through secession , where you could stay home and be where you want to be", "context_len": 65}}}, "opposition": {"freq": 33, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 33, "word_index": 50, "context": "A first bill to amend the statutory limitations period and supersede the `` Ledbetter '' decision was introduced in the 110th United States Congr