ral and automatically self-organising", "context_len": 28}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "In his final years , he attended astronomy symposia at Swarthmore College and spent time at Sproul Observatory", "context_len": 18}}}, "mayors": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 0, "context": "Mayors ( ) of East Berlin , capital in the socialist state of German Democratic Republic", "context_len": 16}}}, "executive": {"freq": 94, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 68, "word_index": 60, "context": "In a December 2016 , op-ed , McMullin blasted Trump as a threat to American constitutional government , saying that the president-elect 's actions were `` consistent with the authoritarian playbook '' and `` undermined critical democratic norms including peaceful debate and transitions of power , commitment to truth , freedom from foreign interference and abstention from the use of executive power for political retribution", "context_len": 65}, "UNK": {"freq": 26, "word_index": 6, "context": "Business class ( also known as executive class or upper class ) is a high quality second-tier travel class available on some commercial airlines and rail lines", "context_len": 27}}}, "administration": {"freq": 104, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 104, "word_index": 52, "context": "Furuya further observes that although active on the web , they lack institutional political representation offline , leading to a sense of frustration and a tendency to be more active online and to back the more right-wing elements of the Liberal Democratic Party of Japan , especially Prime Minister Shinzo Abe 's administration as a substitute for having a party of their own", "context_len": 63}}}, "management": {"freq": 48, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 48, "word_index": 10, "context": "Among the most known world systems , loaded with the management of the professional and amateur designations as champions in the `` boxes pieds-poings '' we have : the WKA ( World Kickboxing Association ) that had be