e container , the water is filling up the marked container", "context_len": 28}, "UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 15, "context": "The tadpoles are long , with powerful tails and low fins , suited for fast flowing water", "context_len": 17}}}, "heels": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 4, "context": "Close on Rose 's heels , the entrepreneur Bonnie Heath soon set up his own thoroughbred horse farm and produced the state 's first Kentucky Derby winner", "context_len": 27}}}, "bright": {"freq": 55, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 48, "word_index": 35, "context": "The leaves are evergreen and needle-like , 8\u201360 mm long , arranged in an open spiral on long shoots , and in dense spiral clusters of 15\u201345 together on short shoots ; they vary from bright grass-green to dark green to strongly glaucous pale blue-green , depending on the thickness of the white wax layer which protects the leaves from drying out", "context_len": 62}, "VERB": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 2, "context": "It has bright perianths ( petals ) with a darker central trumpet ( paracorolla or `` corona '' )", "context_len": 19}}}, "wigs": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 16, "context": "Johnson was tall , thin and wore long flowing clothes , red high heels and bright wigs", "context_len": 17}}}, "tended": {"freq": 12, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 12, "word_index": 72, "context": "`` Pr\u00eat '' additionally observed that Davis chose to work with very basic shapes and inject something hidden or unexpected into them which he described as classic with a twist ; that he focused primarily on playing up and enhancing the feminine form ; and that to further emphasize his attention to shape , he - with a keen focus on the waist and hips for both day and evening wear - tended to stay away from loud prints and patterns and designs", "context_len": 83}}}, "draw": {"freq": 39, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 17, "word_index": 16, "context": "On 21 June 2019 , Licypriya started sp