on newspapers for fear of becoming ill", "context_len": 36}}}, "secondary": {"freq": 54, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 54, "word_index": 39, "context": "The Philippine highway network is a network of roads that are maintained by the Department of Public Works and Highways ( DPWH ) and made into three types according to their function or purpose : national primary , national secondary and national tertiary", "context_len": 43}}}, "enrolling": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 1, "context": "After enrolling in philological studies at the University of Oslo in 1945 he graduated with the cand", "context_len": 17}}}, "philological": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "After enrolling in philological studies at the University of Oslo in 1945 he graduated with the cand", "context_len": 17}}}, "master": {"freq": 78, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 77, "word_index": 6, "context": "Thomas Raine ( 1793-1860 ) , master of the ship `` Surry '' of London , had called it `` Henderson 's Island '' as it appeared to him from the conversation he had with James Henderson at Valparaiso to be his discovery on his last voyage to India from that port in the ship `` Hercules ''", "context_len": 58}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "They teach Spyro to master their elements after he rescues them", "context_len": 11}}}, "thesis": {"freq": 16, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 16, "word_index": 11, "context": "The movie is about a graduate student in Chicago finishing a thesis on urban legends , which leads her to the legend of `` Candyman '' , the ghost of an artist and son of a slave who was murdered in the late 19th century", "context_len": 45}}}, "causality": {"freq": 10, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 10, "word_index": 6, "context": "It is also essential that ontological causality does not suggest the temporal relation of before and after - between the cause and the effect ; that spontaneity ( in nature ) and chance ( in the sphere of moral