erican Dad ! `` , both created by her brother Seth MacFarlane", "context_len": 75}}}, "songs": {"freq": 247, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 247, "word_index": 95, "context": "to doing things that felt very much like older Linkin Park , like mixing hip-hop with a rock chorus , [ we ] felt like , if we were going to do it , we need to really do it in a way that felt natural and felt original and felt like it was something we had n't done in the past , '' said Chester Bennington in an interview with MTV News who referred to Linkin Park 's new style as less technical and more organic : `` [ While ] there are hip-hop songs on the album - 'Wretches and Kings ' , 'When They Come for Me ' they 're like nothing the band have tried before : snarling , raw , dark and [", "context_len": 128}}}, "ballads": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 11, "context": "Her music has also been seen as `` emotional '' power ballads with her music focused in ending relationships , mental health , and sadness", "context_len": 25}}}, "composed": {"freq": 94, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 93, "word_index": 20, "context": "In the 18th century AD , the `` Vijay Panchali '' ( also spelled as `` Bijoy Panchali '' ) composed by Shantidas Goswami , a Hindu missionary , attempting to erase the history and the culture of Manipur , projected the land of northeast India 's Manipur as the Manipur of the Mahabharata and claimed Babruvahana ( Arjuna 's son ) as the father of King Nongda Lairen Pakhangba , by identifying him as `` Yavistha ''", "context_len": 78}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": null, "context": null, "context_len": 0}}}, "arranged": {"freq": 29, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 29, "word_index": 2, "context": "Competitions were arranged in lot of different styles of combat ; like Jhoon Rhee 's United States National Karate Championship , the Ed Parker 's Battle of Atlanta , and from the 1963 they opens on ring of Bando kickboxing ( form come to have of the ancient Burmese boxing