n", "context_len": 63}}}, "businesswoman": {"freq": 17, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 17, "word_index": 19, "context": "Elisabeth `` Betsy '' DeVos ( n\u00e9e Prince ; born January 8 , 1958 ) is an American billionaire businesswoman , philanthropist , and education activist from Michigan", "context_len": 28}}}, "brands": {"freq": 16, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 16, "word_index": 36, "context": "At WrestleMania 25 , The Col\u00f3ns ( Primo and Carlito ) defeated WWE Tag Team Champions The Miz and John Morrison to unify both championships ( which also meant it could be defended on all three brands : Raw , SmackDown and ECW )", "context_len": 44}}}, "singers": {"freq": 42, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 42, "word_index": 11, "context": "But he has also received several Venezuelan and international artists and singers like Juanes , Man\u00e1 , Desorden P\u00fablico , Caramelos de Cianuro , Franco De Vita , Paulina Rubio , Chino y Nacho , Don Omar , Tito El Bambino , Molotov , Wisin & amp ; Yandel , Dalmata , Vos Veis , Los Hombres G , Aterciopelados , Jorge Celed\u00f3n , Jean Carlos Centeno , L'squadron , Tecupae , Luis Silva , Armando Mart\u00ednez , among others", "context_len": 80}}}, "miniseries": {"freq": 11, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 9, "word_index": 17, "context": "Super Hero Time joining `` Kaitou Sentai Lupinranger VS Keisatsu Sentai Patranger '' and later , the miniseries `` Super Sentai Strongest Battle '' aired alongside `` Kishiryu Sentai Ryusoulger ''", "context_len": 31}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 12, "context": "He is known for playing Isaac Mensah in the BBC One drama miniseries `` Dark Money '' , Thomas in the American television series `` The Alienist '' , Young Tim Goodman in `` '' and for voicing the title character in the animated series `` Ricky Zoom ''", "context_len": 49}}}, "rugby": {"freq": 39, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 3, "context": "Tiny Hill ( rugby union )", "context_len": 6}, "NOUN": {"freq": 34, "word_index": 44, "c