words can be interleaved on a symbol basis before being", "context_len": 15}}}, "rainforest": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 27, "context": "Austin , Seasons 1-3 ; Matt Hunter , Season 4 ; Brandon Zambrano , Season 5 ) , who helps animals in danger , mainly in the rainforest", "context_len": 28}}}, "trace": {"freq": 10, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 3, "context": "The concentrations of trace gases in the atmosphere have changed over time and so have the chemical processes which make and destroy compounds in the air", "context_len": 26}, "VERB": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 2, "context": "The Nashyas trace their origin to the indigenous communities of Koch Rajbongshi of northern West Bengal , though some of them are also from Mech community", "context_len": 26}}}, "settlements": {"freq": 34, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 34, "word_index": 21, "context": "`` UN-Habitat '' is working in Fiji with the `` Accelerator Lab Pacific '' to find solutions for the 13 informal settlements in the central and western parts of Fiji ( in the municipality of Lami , Sigatoka , Nadi and Lautoka )", "context_len": 43}}}, "dates": {"freq": 47, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 29, "word_index": 12, "context": "Most stores will rotate stock by moving the products with the earliest dates to the front of shelving units , which allows them to be sold first and saving them from having to be either marked down or thrown away , both of which contribute to a loss of profit", "context_len": 50}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 18, "word_index": 7, "context": "The history of the castle of Macconago dates back to 1030 when a square defensive structure was first erected , completed in 1040 with the construction of a series of watchtowers", "context_len": 31}}}, "yearly": {"freq": 39, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 39, "word_index": 39, "context": "Ocala is well known as the horse capital of the world , one of only five cities ( four in the USA and one in France ) allowed under Chamber of Comme