cord of his later years of unspeakable misery , and unpardonable crime-he calls himself William Wilson because , although denouncing his profligate past , he does not accept full blame for his actions , saying that `` man was never thus", "context_len": 59}}}, "separatist": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 16, "context": "A relatively safe regional pocket , Kathua was spared the decade-long insurrection sparked by the Khalistan separatist movement in Punjab that ended in the early 1990s , just to its south , and the ongoing Freedom movement in Kashmir Valley farther to the north , beginning in the 1980s", "context_len": 49}}}, "coin": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 2, "context": "A meme coin ( also spelled memecoin ) is a cryptocurrency that becomes an Internet meme or other joke", "context_len": 19}}}, "joke": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 28, "context": "On August 7 , 2014 , it was announced that Del Rio had been fired from the WWE after he slapped an employee who allegedly made a racist joke", "context_len": 29}}}, "wade": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "It may be used in the wade sense like a critique of the cryptocurrency market etc", "context_len": 16}, "NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 0, "context": "Wade '' , Rodrigo sang `` Fuck You '' , with British singer Lily Allen , at Glastonbury Festival", "context_len": 19}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "He told the Commodore that he should `` wade ashore '' if his `` fleet '' was ever in danger", "context_len": 20}}}, "critique": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "It may be used in the wade sense like a critique of the cryptocurrency market etc", "context_len": 16}}}, "humorous": {"freq": 11, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 11, "word_index": 38, "context": "That time , Vanguard released albums by Michigan-based rock groups such as Dick Wagner and The Frost and was inspired by a novelty hit they released , Benny Bell 's `` Shaving Cream '' to release albums of humorous music inspired by Dr", "context_len": 43}}}, "tone": {"freq": 27, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 26, "word_index": 11, "context": "Garroway was one of the broadcasters who introduced conversational style and tone to television , beginning some broadcasts as though the viewer were sitting in the studio with him , as in this November 20 , 1957 , introduction for the `` Today '' show : `` And how are you about the world today ? Let 's see what kind of shape it 's in ; there is a glimmer of hope", "context_len": 73}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "Chalk may be added to the pastel to tone down the more vivd colors", "context_len": 14}}}, "coins": {"freq": 42, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 40, "word_index": 2, "context": "Unlike numismatic coins , a bullion coin is a coin , new or old , that is bought only for the price of the metal it is made of , not for its condition , age or any other value , british gold sovereigns are a common historic bullion coin , and most countries produce a coin meant solely for bullion purposes in different weights , e", "context_len": 67}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 31, "context": "Bullion can also be in the form of bars of precious metal in different weights ( and thus sizes ) bars can easily be stacked and are easier to sort then coins as only the weight needs to be taken into consideration", "context_len": 42}}}, "engineers": {"freq": 21, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 21, "word_index": 43, "context": "But maybe the biggest legacy , or way they have been remembered , of their deaths is the change that happened in the space program : since the Apollo 1 fire , there has never been another fire in an American spacecraft \u2013 engineers learned that very painful lesson during the fire in Apollo 1 and have done everything they can to make sure another fire can never happen", "context_len": 69}}}, "circulating": {"freq": 4, "P