ical intention ( to pay them ) ''", "context_len": 47}}}, "nor": {"freq": 28, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 28, "word_index": 71, "context": "`` You will no doubt be surprised to receive a note from the ( now by all account ) noted Piesley ; but , Sir , through your valuable paper I must make it known that , if it be my lot to be taken , whether dead or alive , I will never be tried for the rescue of Gardiner , in the light in which it is presented ; nor did I ever fire at Trooper Hosie", "context_len": 79}}}, "intention": {"freq": 12, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 12, "word_index": 26, "context": "Claiming lead from Justice Ruth Ginsburg 's minority opinion , which invited the Congress to take action by amending the law , the Democrats announced their intention to intervene : House Majority Leader Steny Hoyer and Education and Labor Committee Chairman George Miller said that a bill was to be passed to avoid future court rulings in line with `` Ledbetter '' , clearly putting that `` a key provision of the legislation will make it clear that discrimination occurs not just when the decision to discriminate is made , but also when someone becomes subject to that discriminatory decision , and when they are affected by that discriminatory decision , including each time they are issued a discriminatory paycheck '' , as said by Rep", "context_len": 126}}}, "deepen": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "As CSR director , he decided to deepen labor controls in the production chain , control measures with which Inditex 's management did not agree", "context_len": 25}}}, "labor": {"freq": 38, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 38, "word_index": 18, "context": "After being inspired by the Third World Liberation movement in California from 1968-1969 , Chen started her own labor movement in 1983 where she was a member in the International Ladies Garment Workers Union \u2019 s ( ILGWU ) and later worked on the ILGWU Immigration Project in 1984", "context_len": 49}}}, "controls": {"freq": 24, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 10, "word_index": 30, "context": "The term is most likely related to the sailing term for the coxswain 's station in a Royal Navy ship , and later the location of the ship 's rudder controls", "context_len": 31}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 14, "word_index": 6, "context": "The combination of beam conditioning devices controls the thermal load ( heating caused by the beam ) at the end station ; the spectrum of radiation incident at the end station ; and the focus or collimation of the beam", "context_len": 40}}}, "euros": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 31, "context": "The construction of the Zaafarana station was funded with soft loans from Denmark , Spain , Japan , and Germany , and it was built at a cost of 110 million euros , and the station is entirely affiliated with the New and Renewable Energy Authority", "context_len": 46}}}, "collapsed": {"freq": 13, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 12, "word_index": 21, "context": "At least ten women or girls , all under the age of 20 , were prisoners in the building when it collapsed on August 13 , 1863 , killing four : Charity McCorkle Kerr , Susan Crawford Vandever , Armenia Crawford Selvey , and Josephine Anderson the 15-year-old sister of William T", "context_len": 52}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "Moments after they fled , the floor they had been standing on collapsed", "context_len": 13}}}, "compensation": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 46, "context": "In 1960 IWT ( Indus Waters Treaty ) was signed ; according to this treaty , India was awarded rights to the Sutlej , Beas , and Ravi rivers , and Pakistan besides the waters of these three rivers within Pakistani territories , and some financial compensation was granted rights to construct the Indus , Chenab , and Jhelum river basins", "context_len": 61}}}, "voluntarily": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 2, "context": "He was voluntarily con