e from settings phone , has been the shutdown option , start screen not support , and startup screen", "context_len": 30}}}, "formation": {"freq": 41, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 41, "word_index": 30, "context": "Before his death , Bush filed a 211-page document with the Military District of Washington , which had a request for an aerial flyover of fighter jets in missing man formation by the United States Air Force during his state funeral , as well as final interment and burial to occur at the George Bush Presidential Library in College Station , Texas", "context_len": 62}}}, "core": {"freq": 41, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 41, "word_index": 22, "context": "However , there is no sign of any second galaxy which would have acted as the `` bullet '' , and the core of Hoag 's object has a very low velocity relative to the ring , making the typical formation hypothesis unlikely", "context_len": 43}}}, "accretion": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 10, "context": "For accreting black holes , all the energy released by accretion does not have to appear as outgoing luminosity , since energy can be lost through the event horizon , down the hole", "context_len": 33}}}, "planets": {"freq": 22, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 22, "word_index": 8, "context": "After the creation of the sky and the planets , Sidaba ( ) ( the Supreme Being ) ordered His wife , Leimarel Sidabi ( ) ( the first woman ) to produce another Leimarel", "context_len": 35}}}, "orbit": {"freq": 21, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 14, "context": "It was n't going to go to the Moon \u2013 it was going to orbit the Earth while the astronauts tested and checked the equipment and machines that would be used to go to the Moon on another flight", "context_len": 39}, "NOUN": {"freq": 15, "word_index": 8, "context": "When the Soviet Union put a satellite into orbit around the Earth , and later a person named Yuri Gagarin , the United States felt that the Soviet Union was getting too far ahead of 