 all alone in a country far from home and in her circumstances , but that it was not an excuse for the abuse", "context_len": 38}}}, "compassion": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 1, "context": "This compassion and understanding allows Umma to finally move on and be at peace , as she had also come to understand that what she did to Amanda was unfair", "context_len": 30}}}, "rediscovering": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "The film ends with Amanda rediscovering her family heritage and sharing it with her daughter , as well as coming to terms with Chrissy \u2019 s need to live her own life", "context_len": 32}}}, "conduction": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 46, "context": "( integral form ) , where H is the magnetic H field ( also called `` auxiliary magnetic field '' , `` magnetic field intensity '' , or just `` magnetic field '' , D is the electric displacement field , and Jf is the enclosed conduction current or free current density", "context_len": 52}}}, "valence": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "The valence band and conduction band are a concept in physics", "context_len": 11}}}, "fermi": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "In other solids , they are the last places before the fermi level", "context_len": 13}}}, "uneducated": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 14, "context": "Early thinkers had the idea that beliefs in totemism came from indiginous clans being uneducated about the difference between humans and animals", "context_len": 22}}}, "doctored": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "The script and dialogue of the film is doctored by famous poet Dr Kumar Vishwas", "context_len": 15}}}, "charismatic": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Ganga Ram Chaudhary , the charismatic and arrogant Chief Minister of the fictiona