nds just outside the ring ropes until he is tagged in by his partner by slapping hands lightly slapping their partners back with the ref watching or both wrestlers can fight at the same time in a `` tornado '' format", "context_len": 46}}}, "establishes": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "Initially meek and subservient , Bimmo quickly learns the ropes and establishes herself as a powerful politician , undergoing an image makeover in the process", "context_len": 25}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 15, "context": "The second book of Samuel tells the story of King David of Israel , who establishes Jerusalem as Israel 's capital city ( 2 Sam 5:7 )", "context_len": 27}}}, "undergoing": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 18, "context": "Initially meek and subservient , Bimmo quickly learns the ropes and establishes herself as a powerful politician , undergoing an image makeover in the process", "context_len": 25}}}, "makeover": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 10, "context": "In 1995 , the mascot was given a more child-friendly makeover , with wider cheeks , a less pointy , shorter snout , longer eyes and smaller ears", "context_len": 28}}}, "meanwhile": {"freq": 23, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 23, "word_index": 0, "context": "Meanwhile , in answer to President Truman 's request for reservists to volunteer for duty during the Korean War , VG-781 requested mobilization as a complete unit , and was accepted \u2013 the first squadron in the nation to do so", "context_len": 41}}}, "superintendent": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 6, "context": "When Jyoti Deswal , a new superintendent , arrives at the jail , Chaudhary 's life takes a turn for the worse", "context_len": 22}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Superintendent Hatfield of the Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Children came aboard the `` Only Son ''", "context_len": 19}}}, "worse": {"f