uring which Khushi attacks and nearly kills Nikhil but is calmed down by Anna , and Vasu convinces Nikhil to confess", "context_len": 27}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "The villain in this story is called Don John and he convinces Claudio that Hero is cheating on him and then he refuses to marry her whilst Benedick and Beatrice are tricked into confessing their true love for each other", "context_len": 40}}}, "thieves": {"freq": 9, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 9, "word_index": 44, "context": "Various spin-offs have aired in the same format , including `` To Catch a Con Man '' , `` To Catch an ID Thief '' , `` To Catch a Car Thief '' and `` To Catch an i-Jacker '' , which featured iPod thieves", "context_len": 45}}}, "stole": {"freq": 13, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 12, "word_index": 27, "context": "In two years Ben Hall 's gang , as well as killing two policemen , had reportedly robbed ten mail coaches , held up 21 properties , stole 23 racing horses , and taken over the village of Canowindra three times", "context_len": 41}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "While the police were out looking for them , the gang stole guns and ammunition from the police camp", "context_len": 19}}}, "switch": {"freq": 9, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 33, "context": "Unicode 's character can be put at the start of a Unicode text to signal its endianness : a program reading such a text and finding 0xFFFE would then know that it should switch the byte order for all the following characters", "context_len": 42}, "NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 18, "context": "`` The commission believed Jarrah tried to make an announcement to the passengers , but keyed the wrong switch , sending the message to Cleveland controllers ; Mohamed Atta had made the same error on Flight 11", "context_len": 37}}}, "dressing": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 12, "context": "These hayrides can put on a show with special effects and actors