rd_index": 9, "context": "He wrote `` Fraszki '' , a cycle of epigrams , `` Pie\u015bni '' ( `` Cantos '' ) and `` Treny '' ( `` Laments '' )", "context_len": 28}}}, "translations": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 8, "context": "Kizuna only speaks Japanese , so fans write translations for her videos", "context_len": 12}}}, "versification": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Kochanowski established rules of Polish versification and introduced sonnet to Polish poetry", "context_len": 12}}}, "sonnet": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 45, "context": "Hist best works are the canzone `` Donna mi prega '' ( `` A lady asks me '' ) , the ballad `` I ' prego voi che di dolor parlate '' ( `` I ask you that speak about suffering '' ) and the sonnet `` L \u2019 anima mia vilment \u2019 \u00e8 sbigotita '' ( `` My soul is in distress '' )", "context_len": 65}}}, "nephew": {"freq": 20, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 17, "word_index": 19, "context": "A flashback narrated by Khushi explains how her boyfriend , Nikhil Surana , a young businessman and Jamnadas ' nephew , killed him in order to obtain the orphanage in his name and demolish it for the construction of a site", "context_len": 41}, "UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 7, "context": "This leaves her niece Lennox and her nephew Ryder without their parents to take care of them", "context_len": 17}}}, "presumptive": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "The assassination of Archduke Franz Ferdinand of Austria , heir presumptive to the throne of Austria-Hungary , and his wife Sophie , Duchess of Hohenberg , happened on 28 June 1914 in Sarajevo", "context_len": 33}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 2, "context": "The heir presumptive of Franz , Duke of Bavaria , is his younger brother", "context_len": 14}}}, "assassins": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 25, "context": "After the death of Ghiyath in 1202 , he became the successor of the Ghurid Empire and ruled until his assassination near Jhelum by Ismaili assassins in 1206", "context_len": 28}}}, "tunnelling": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "Quantum tunnelling", "context_len": 2}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "Quantum tunnelling is a part of the theoretical branch of physics known as quantum mechanics", "context_len": 15}}}, "quantum": {"freq": 20, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 14, "word_index": 24, "context": "Dieguez wrote that the authors of `` Irreducible Mind '' took reports of paranormal phenomena and wild claims at face value , talked `` quantum babble '' and formed an ignorant `` soul of the gaps '' argument", "context_len": 38}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 31, "context": "It states that electrons can behave like both particles and waves , and can cancel the effects of an energy barrier if the energy barrier is thin enough , due to quantum mechanics being dependent on probability", "context_len": 37}, "UNK": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 6, "context": "Deepak Chopra coined the term `` quantum healing '' when he published the first edition of his book with that title in 1989", "context_len": 23}}}, "mechanics": {"freq": 28, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 28, "word_index": 32, "context": "It states that electrons can behave like both particles and waves , and can cancel the effects of an energy barrier if the energy barrier is thin enough , due to quantum mechanics being dependent on probability", "context_len": 37}}}, "electrons": {"freq": 27, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 27, "word_index": 27, "context": "When the magnetization of both the magnetic material are in the same direction or parallel , the resistance in the sandwiched layer becomes low so that the electrons in that layer have spins all aligned in one direction - either all up or all down , allowing a new way to store binary data in the form of one 's ( all spins up ) and zeroes ( all spins down )", "context_len": 72}}}, "behave": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 29, "context": "When a material is magnetized ( for example , by placing it in an external magnetic field ) , the electrons remain bound to their respective atoms , but behave as if they were orbiting the nucleus in a particular direction , creating a microscopic current", "context_len": 46}}}, "particles": {"freq": 38, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 38, "word_index": 8, "context": "It states that electrons can behave like both particles and waves , and can cancel the effects of an energy barrier if the energy barrier is thin enough , due to quantum mechanics being dependent on probability", "context_len": 37}}}, "cancel": {"freq": 12, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 12, "word_index": 71, "context": "If the separation between the top surface of the first piece of glass and the top surface of the second piece of glass is , at some point , such that light beams reflected from each are synchronized or in phase , then the reflected light will be bright , but if the two beams are half a cycle out of phase , then at that point the two beams will cancel each other and what reflected light there is will not be bright", "context_len": 84}}}, "dependent": {"freq": 14, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 13, "word_index": 17, "context": "So in its simplest form , an equation of state is a function , that takes these dependent variables as input , the state can then be as simple as saying that in its current state , the function has the numerical value zero :", "context_len": 45}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "It is about how much dependent you are on other people or your parents , how much pampered you are or how much difficult it is for you to be in a different place", "context_len": 34}}}, "doors": {"freq": 19, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 19, "word_index": 67, "context": "For example , if there are cleaners in the office building , and each cleaner only cleans one floor , the cleaner for a each floor could have a `` sub-master '' key that opens only the offices on that floor , while each employee still has a key that opens only his her office and the manager still has a key that opens all of the doors", "context_len": 68}}}, "subatomic": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 7, "context": "However , this only noticeably works for subatomic particles , as the chance for macroscopic objects to do this is very , very low , small enough to not be thought about much", "context_len": 33}}}, "quark": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "The particle usually a subatomic or quark particle such as an electron or photon can become a wave to focus a great deal of energy on the barrier , ultimately negating it", "context_len": 32}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "She took part in the discovery of the top quark in 1995 and the Higgs boson in 2012", "context_len": 18}}}, "particle": {"freq": 32, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 32, "word_index": 6, "context": "where `` e '' is the particle charge , `` B '' is the magnetic field , `` formula 3 '' , `` formula 4 '' is the electron rest mass and `` c '' is the speed of light , characterizes the nature of the electron motion", "context_len": 48}}}, "ultimately": {"freq": 10, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 10, "word_index": 25, "context": "ABC Studios is an American television production studio under the Disney Television Studios unit of Walt Disney Television that was named in 2020 ( both ultimately owned by The Walt Disney Company )", "context_len": 33}}}, "negating": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 30, "context": "The particle usually a subatomic or quark particle such as an electron or photon can become a wave to focus a great deal of energy on the barrier , ultimately negating it", "context_len": 32}}}, "noticeably": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 4, "context": "However , this only noticeably works for subatomic particles ,