e also becoming the `` WWF Tag Team Champions ''", "context_len": 102}}}, "encyclopedia": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 23, "context": "As of 2021 , it is the Norwegian newspaper with the highest number of readers , according to Store norske leksikon ( an encyclopedia )", "context_len": 25}}}, "georgian": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Georgian Wikipedia started in November 2003", "context_len": 6}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Georgian is the official and primary language of Georgia", "context_len": 9}}}, "austronesian": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "Malagasy is an austronesian language mostly spoken in Madagascar as the first language", "context_len": 13}}}, "wikipedia": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 1, "context": "This wikipedia has 3 administrators along with 13,423 registered users and 42 active users", "context_len": 14}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "The total number of articles written in this wikipedia edition is 69,865", "context_len": 12}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "There are about 54 active users of this wikipedia out of a total number of 21,495 users", "context_len": 17}}}, "tessellation": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Tessellation of a flat surface refers to the repeated placement of shapes with no overlaps and no gaps", "context_len": 18}}}, "overlaps": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "Tessellation of a flat surface refers to the repeated placement of shapes with no overlaps and no gaps", "context_len": 18}}}, "gaps": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 35, "context": "Dieguez wrote that the authors of `` Irreducible Mind '' took reports of paranormal phenomena and wild claims at face value , talked `` quantum babble '' and formed an ignorant `` soul of the gaps '' argument",