devised": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 6, "context": "The walks on ordinals method Todor\u010devi\u0107 devised in May 1984 when he came up with a new proof of the existence of a Countryman line", "context_len": 25}}}, "rho": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 5, "context": "Todor\u010devi\u0107 used his newly discovered rho functions to increase the colours not just to 4 , but all the way up to the smallest uncountable cardinal , which is the maximum conceivable number", "context_len": 33}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "The discovery of rho functions ( and the various applications they have found ) , an entirely new mathematical object , one out of the five in Set theory in the twentieth century , is celebrated as a major advance in understanding of mathematics and an extended period of exciting progress", "context_len": 51}}}, "coloured": {"freq": 13, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 11, "word_index": 1, "context": "He coloured the edges of formula 9 with 2 colours in such a way that each colour appears on some edge of any uncountable subgraph of formula 9", "context_len": 28}, "UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 11, "context": "They mainly come in black , sometimes with a band of coloured fabric around the rim", "context_len": 16}}}, "conceivable": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 31, "context": "Todor\u010devi\u0107 used his newly discovered rho functions to increase the colours not just to 4 , but all the way up to the smallest uncountable cardinal , which is the maximum conceivable number", "context_len": 33}}}, "exciting": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 49, "context": "The discovery of rho functions ( and the various applications they have found ) , an entirely new mathematical object , one out of the five in Set theory in the twentieth century , is celebrated as a major advance in understanding of mathematics and an extended period of exciting progress", "context_len": 51}, "UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 37, "context": "But all the material 's just kind of coming together , and every week we meet up and assess the situation and for the rest of the week we just go and work on whatever we find exciting", "context_len": 38}}}, "monograph": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 10, "context": "He coined the word 'symbiosis ' in 1879 in his monograph as `` the living together of unlike organisms ''", "context_len": 20}}}, "theorems": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 27, "context": "the S-space problem and the L-space problem turn out to be useful in many other problems in general topology , writing `` this is so because Ramsey-type theorems are basic and so much needed in many parts of mathematics and ( S ) and ( L ) happen to be Ramsey-type properties of the uncountable most often needed by the topologist ''", "context_len": 62}}}, "topologist": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 60, "context": "the S-space problem and the L-space problem turn out to be useful in many other problems in general topology , writing `` this is so because Ramsey-type theorems are basic and so much needed in many parts of mathematics and ( S ) and ( L ) happen to be Ramsey-type properties of the uncountable most often needed by the topologist ''", "context_len": 62}}}, "appraisal": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "In the 2016 RSC fellowship nomination detailed appraisal it was written :", "context_len": 12}}}, "dissertation": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 12, "context": "In 1955 , he earned his doctorate from Leiden University with a dissertation which was later published as a book , `` De Hikajat Atjeh '' ( )", "context_len": 28}}}, "celebrating": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 10, "context": "28am on 2 December 2011 , just 12 days after celebrating her 115th birthday , and was succeeded as