haman who knows about good magic to do certain spells and rituals that can return a skin-walker 's evil back to them", "context_len": 37}}}, "aboriginal": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 34, "context": "Rates are high among the peoples of the Pacific Islands and the M\u0101ori of New Zealand , but rare in Australian aborigines , despite a higher average concentration of serum uric acid in the aboriginal group", "context_len": 36}}}, "cruelty": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 8, "context": "At last , in `` The reward of cruelty '' , his body is taken from the gallows after his execution and is cut up into pieces by surgeons", "context_len": 29}}}, "investigating": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 8, "context": "He was also arrested in 2012 by police investigating complaints against Jimmy Savile and questioned and has been monitored by Police in an investigation code named Operation Yewtree and is one of the most hated people", "context_len": 36}}}, "opposes": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 10, "context": "McMullin supports keeping the Guantanamo Bay detention camp open and opposes the use of torture and has criticized Trump 's support for it", "context_len": 23}}}, "sanctuaries": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 19, "context": "2 Machu Picchu is made up of more than 150 buildings ranging from baths and houses to temples and sanctuaries", "context_len": 20}}}, "shelters": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 7, "context": "In 1866 , Alger began visiting the shelters for homeless boys in the city such as the YMCA , the Five Points Mission , and the Newsboys Lodging House", "context_len": 29}}}, "humane": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 8, "context": "Their first goal was to get laws about humane slaughter passed", "context_len": 11}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "He was also active in effort