": "Led by a research team from the Egyptian Museum and the University of California , the scientists used oxygen isotope analysis to examine hairs from two baboon mummies that had been preserved in the British Museum", "context_len": 36}}}, "mummies": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 7, "context": "The researchers at first found that the mummies most closely matched modern specimens seen in Eritrea and Ethiopia as opposed to those in neighbouring Somalia , with the Ethiopian specimens `` basically due west from Eritrea ''", "context_len": 37}}}, "distorted": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 55, "context": "In March 2005 , measurements by the Solar Wind Anisotropies ( SWAN ) instrument onboard the Solar and Heliospheric Observatory ( SOHO ) showed that the heliosphere , the solar wind-filled volume which prevents the solar system from becoming embedded in the local ( ambient ) interstellar medium , is not axisymmetrical , but is distorted , very likely under the effect of the local galactic magnetic field", "context_len": 68}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "The techniques involved are abstinence , lessening of homosexual temptations and correcting distorted style of relations to the same or opposite gender", "context_len": 22}}}, "isotopic": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 18, "context": "The scientists believed that such an analysis would yield similar results since , according to them , regional isotopic maps suggest that baboons in Yemen would closely resemble those in Somalia", "context_len": 31}}}, "compare": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 0, "context": "Compare this with Wilson 's theorem , which states that every prime `` p '' divides ( `` p '' 1 ) ! 1", "context_len": 24}}}, "yield": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 8, "context": "The scientists believed that such an analysis would yield similar results since , according to them , regional isotopic maps suggest that baboons in Yemen would closely resemble those in Somalia", "context_len": 31}}}, "resemble": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 54, "context": "Tobias `` Toby '' Sheldon ( born Tobias Strebel ; October 3 , 1980 \u2013 August 21 , 2015 ) was a German songwriter who became a television reality star noted for having paid considerable amounts for plastic surgery ( he himself estimated the total cost at over $ 100,000 ) in order to resemble singer Justin Bieber", "context_len": 58}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "Hoatzins communicate through unusual sounds that resemble wheezing , grunting , growls , and hisses", "context_len": 15}}}, "circumscribed": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 21, "context": "Professor Dominy , one of the lead researchers , concluded from this that `` we think Punt is a sort of circumscribed region that includes eastern Ethiopia and all of Eritrea", "context_len": 31}, "VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "The subfamily as currently circumscribed has a cosmopolitan distribution , with about 1,400 species accepted", "context_len": 15}}}, "followup": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 8, "context": "`` In 2015 , the scientists conducted a followup study to confirm their initial findings , and concluded that `` our results reveal a high likelihood match with eastern Somalia and the Eritrea-Ethiopia corridor , suggesting that this region was the source of Papio hamadryas exported to Ancient Egypt", "context_len": 49}}}, "likelihood": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 2, "context": "If the likelihood of failure is constant with respect to time ( for example , in some product like a brick or protected steel beam ) , and ignoring the time to recover from failure , failure rate is simply the inverse of the Mean Time Between Failures ( MTBF )", "context_len": 51}}}, "dominates": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_Pre