pal in an empty bungalow , a fight ensues between the boys", "context_len": 22}}}, "ensues": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 18, "context": "One day , when Madhav pranks and scares the timid Gopal in an empty bungalow , a fight ensues between the boys", "context_len": 22}}}, "prompts": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Gopal gets punished , which prompts Gopal and Laxman to leave the orphanage , and soon , Madhav , Lucky and Laxman also do the same", "context_len": 26}, "NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "Next , the ghost possesses Madhav and prompts Vasooli to give them a task , indirectly bringing the three back to Ooty", "context_len": 22}}}, "reunites": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 1, "context": "Om reunites with Sandy and waves at Shanti who tearfully smiles at him and disappears , having finally attained peace", "context_len": 20}}}, "caretaker": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 18, "context": "Six months after the coup , on 1 August 2021 , Min Aung Hlaing replaced SAC with a caretaker government and established himself as the country 's prime minister", "context_len": 29}}}, "indirectly": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 6, "context": "A figure of speech which refers indirectly to a situation , and leaves the reader ( or audience ) to make the connection", "context_len": 23}}}, "scare": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 13, "context": "They convince Gopal to stop chasing the goons and later almost manage to scare Vasu into confessing the truth , but Nikhil arrives before they can and reveals there 's no evidence to prove him guilty", "context_len": 36}}}, "assigns": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 10, "context": "While the Philippine Atmospheric , Geophysical and Astronomical Services Administration assigns names to tropical cyclones which move into or form a