othing more to eat , they will eat the rich ! )", "context_len": 48}}}, "superabundant": {"freq": 14, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 13, "word_index": 9, "context": "Basically , they proved that if a number is superabundant , the exponent of a larger prime number is never bigger than a smaller prime number during prime decomposition ( the process of a composite number become smaller prime numbers )", "context_len": 41}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "Any natural number `` n '' is called superabundant when a certain equation is true", "context_len": 15}}}, "sigma": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "For every number less than 8 , the sigma is 1 , 3 , 4 , 7 , 6 , 10 , 8 and 16", "context_len": 25}}}, "exponent": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 12, "context": "Basically , they proved that if a number is superabundant , the exponent of a larger prime number is never bigger than a smaller prime number during prime decomposition ( the process of a composite number become smaller prime numbers )", "context_len": 41}}}, "primes": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 11, "context": "It is generally accepted that the original transformers , the 13 primes , were created by Primus , the god of the Transfomers , to stop Unicron , the dark god", "context_len": 31}}}, "eyeliner": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 13, "context": "The '60s and '70s also saw new fashion trends which made use of eyeliner , eyeshadow and mascara in new ways", "context_len": 21}}}, "contours": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "It is applied around the contours of the eyes to create different aesthetic effects", "context_len": 14}}}, "aesthetic": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 7, "context": "Despite their obvious differences in temperament and aesthetic preference , they eventually became good friends", "context_len": 15}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1,