al": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "This usage of the anthropic principle is tautological", "context_len": 8}}}, "teleological": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 16, "context": "Much of Aristotle 's description of human nature is still influential today , but the particular teleological idea that humans are `` meant '' or intended to be something , has become much less popular in modern times", "context_len": 38}}}, "tours": {"freq": 16, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 15, "word_index": 16, "context": "The people of Berlin always cheered the king when he returned to the city from provincial tours or military reviews , but Frederick took no pleasure from his popularity with the common folk , preferring instead the company of his pet Italian greyhounds , whom he referred to as his 'marquises de Pompadour ' as a jibe at Madame de Pompadour", "context_len": 61}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "Jackson Street in Springfield , Illinois and is open to tours on Tuesday , Thursday and Saturday mornings , free of charge", "context_len": 22}}}, "gigs": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "Before 2013 , they did 938 gigs", "context_len": 7}}}, "keyboardists": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "Alessandro Cortini ( one of the band 's keyboardists ) said that how the band plays in studios and in CDs is different from how they play in concerts", "context_len": 29}}}, "sustaining": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 11, "context": "Shakti is the personification of the energy that is creative , sustaining , as well as destructive , sometimes referred to as auspicious source energy", "context_len": 25}}}, "auspicious": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 22, "context": "Shakti is the personification of the energy that is creative , sustaining , as well as destructive , sometimes referred to as auspi