how , indicating a location in the Western United States , it is never revealed which state the show is set in ( except for Francis 's whereabouts in early seasons , such as his military school in Alabama and his job in Alaska )", "context_len": 63}}}, "boiling": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 8, "context": "Bullion ( from the french word for `` boiling '' ) refers to coins , jewellery and bars made of a precious metal such as gold or silver , that are bought and stored simply as an investment in the prices of the metal ( s ) they are made of", "context_len": 51}, "NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 18, "context": "As of 2007 in the United States , there are 104 ( 69 pressurized water reactors and 35 boiling water reactors ) commercial nuclear generating units licensed to operate , producing a total of 97,400 megawatts ( electric ) , which is approximately 20 % of the nation 's total electric energy consumption", "context_len": 53}}}, "bullion": {"freq": 10, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 10, "word_index": 0, "context": "Bullion can also be in the form of bars of precious metal in different weights ( and thus sizes ) bars can easily be stacked and are easier to sort then coins as only the weight needs to be taken into consideration", "context_len": 42}}}, "uncertainty": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 32, "context": "Although precious metal bullion is no longer used to make coins for general circulation , it continues to be held as an investment with a reputation for stability in periods of economic uncertainty", "context_len": 33}}}, "numismatic": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 1, "context": "Unlike numismatic coins , a bullion coin is a coin , new or old , that is bought only for the price of the metal it is made of , not for its condition , age or any other value , british gold sovereigns are a common historic bullion coin , and most countries produce a coin meant solely for bullion purposes in different weights , e", "context_len": 67}}}, "sovereigns": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 43, "context": "Unlike numismatic coins , a bullion coin is a coin , new or old , that is bought only for the price of the metal it is made of , not for its condition , age or any other value , british gold sovereigns are a common historic bullion coin , and most countries produce a coin meant solely for bullion purposes in different weights , e", "context_len": 67}}}, "stacked": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 24, "context": "Bullion can also be in the form of bars of precious metal in different weights ( and thus sizes ) bars can easily be stacked and are easier to sort then coins as only the weight needs to be taken into consideration", "context_len": 42}}}, "pocket": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 4, "context": "A relatively safe regional pocket , Kathua was spared the decade-long insurrection sparked by the Khalistan separatist movement in Punjab that ended in the early 1990s , just to its south , and the ongoing Freedom movement in Kashmir Valley farther to the north , beginning in the 1980s", "context_len": 49}}}, "pendants": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "It may also be jewellery such as neck chains , pocket watch cases and pendants", "context_len": 15}}}, "burglaries": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 18, "context": "Due to it 's relatively small size and high value , bullion is often stolen in robberies and burglaries , as a result it is mainly stored in safes , some people who invest in bullion may choose to pay to have it stored in a safe deposit box at a local bank , rather then a safe in their own home", "context_len": 62}}}, "safes": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 28, "context": "Due to it 's relatively small size and high value , bullion is often stolen in robberies and burglaries , as a result it is mai