2 taping of the Teen Tournament which made it unfair for contestants who played in the semifinal before the zero loss", "context_len": 36}, "VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 0, "context": "Taping occurs over a period of two days , with the five quarterfinals played on the first day and the three semifinals and two final games played on the second day", "context_len": 31}}}, "whichever": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "`` The other two players win smaller cash prizes or their two-day total , whichever is higher", "context_len": 17}}}, "taped": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 14, "context": "A new set came out with the Tournament of Champions and Celebrity Jeopardy ! taped in 2009 at the Consumer Electronics Show in Las Vegas , Nevada", "context_len": 27}}}, "guarantees": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 6, "context": "Note that TEC dates are not guarantees ; hard drives can and will either last much longer or fail much sooner than the date given by a TEC", "context_len": 28}}}, "parentheses": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 3, "context": "The quantity in parentheses on the right hand side is in fact ( twice ) the mean curvature of the surface ( depending on normalization )", "context_len": 26}}}, "mailed": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 2, "context": "Would-be contestants mailed postcards with their names and addresses to `` Jeopardy ! ''", "context_len": 14}}}, "postcards": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 3, "context": "Would-be contestants mailed postcards with their names and addresses to `` Jeopardy ! ''", "context_len": 14}}}, "teens": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 3, "context": "In her middle teens , Warren briefly taught school in Middleborough , then began appearing as an exhibit in a relative 's `` floating palace of curiosities '' on the Ohio and Mississippi rivers", "context_len": 34}}}, "postcard": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "1,200 teens were selected at random from the postcard entries and were invited to come ( at their own expense ) to one of four regional test centers ( `` e", "context_len": 31}}}, "timed": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 14, "context": "`` Houston , Minneapolis , Philadelphia , and Los Angeles ) to take a timed written qualifying examination with the 50 clues read by Alex Trebek on a video monitor at the front of an exam room", "context_len": 37}, "VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 2, "context": "People are timed and the person who is quickest wins", "context_len": 10}}}, "buzzer": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "Passing scorers were invited back for an interview and mock game using an electronic buzzer system", "context_len": 16}}}, "alternates": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 30, "context": "In volcanic areas a pattern of deposition in lakes may be regularly interrupted by eruptions of volcanic ash , so that in the record of the rocks shales and mudstone alternates with tuff", "context_len": 33}}}, "notified": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 7, "context": "The survivors returned to Taivu Point , notified 17th Army headquarters of their defeat and waited for new soldiers and orders from Rabaul", "context_len": 23}}}, "accommodations": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 0, "context": "Accommodations were provided for the contestants at the Beverly Hilton in Beverly Hills , with taping taking place at the Sony Pictures Studios in Culver City , California", "context_len": 28}}}, "registrants": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 7, "context": "As before , a select number of registrants were invited to audition and take a written test at a regional audition", "context_len": 21}}}, "takers": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"N