s", "context_len": 34}}}, "confectionery": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "Ferrero is an Italian food company that produces chocolate and confectionery", "context_len": 11}}}, "southerly": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 12, "context": "The village is in the civil parish of Landewednack , the most southerly parish on the British mainland", "context_len": 18}}}, "aerospace": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 18, "context": "MTBF is an important specification parameter in all aspects of high importance engineering design\u2013such as naval architecture , aerospace engineering , automotive design , etc", "context_len": 25}}}, "interceptor": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 53, "context": "On board during the first quarter of 1948 were a light carrier aircraft group ( CLG ) ; two carrier air groups ; two escort carrier air groups ; two patrol plane squadrons ; three transport squadrons ; four fleet aircraft service squadrons ; two Marine fighting squadrons and a Marine ground control interceptor unit ; two volunteer units , one at Litchfield , one on the station proper ; a NATS Unit ; GCA ; and an all-weather station", "context_len": 80}}}, "planner": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "During his NASA career , he worked as a flight director and planner", "context_len": 13}}}, "phonetic": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 10, "context": "Since the Chinese language has not had any sort of phonetic alphabet until only about a few hundred years ago ( compared to the thousands of years the Chinese characters have been used ) , there has been a lot of confusion on naming places in Chinese", "context_len": 47}}}, "logographic": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 5, "context": "Since Chinese characters are a logographic writing system , meaning that the writing mainly shows the words ' meaning rather than its