tember 1987 stated that ladies dressed in Davis-designed wardrobes would look strong , confident , and elegant \u2013 not to mention , in many instances , frankly sexy", "context_len": 34}}}, "couture": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 22, "context": "`` Taxi '' ( November 1986 ) commented that being young and having no financial backing did not intimidate Davis from creating couture clothing of the highest level ; that respect should be paid to him and fashion magazine should acknowledge him and take the initiative to put him on the map ; and also that a lady dressed in Davis \u2019 s clothes would not only be taken seriously , but would be praised for her good taste and silent elegance - daring to detach herself from the uniforms of a working machine", "context_len": 94}}}, "minimalism": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 43, "context": "Fashion columnists of the `` Dallas Morning News '' ( 18 December 1985 ) reported that Davis \u2019 s work was strongly influenced by the great masters of couture , but that he managed to move forward adding his own signature of modern minimalism", "context_len": 44}}}, "intimidate": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 18, "context": "`` Taxi '' ( November 1986 ) commented that being young and having no financial backing did not intimidate Davis from creating couture clothing of the highest level ; that respect should be paid to him and fashion magazine should acknowledge him and take the initiative to put him on the map ; and also that a lady dressed in Davis \u2019 s clothes would not only be taken seriously , but would be praised for her good taste and silent elegance - daring to detach herself from the uniforms of a working machine", "context_len": 94}}}, "acknowledge": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 40, "context": "`` Taxi '' ( November 1986 ) commented that being young and having no financial backing did not intimidate Davis from creating coutur