ext_len": 40}}}, "uplift": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 24, "context": "The outline of the rock once resembled a teapot and gave its name to several man-made and natural features , including a geologic structural uplift known as the Teapot Dome , and an oil field about east", "context_len": 37}}}, "likewise": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 0, "context": "Likewise , the Florida Panthers attempted to draft Russian hockey phenomenon Alexander Ovechkin in 2003 , even though his birthday was two days after the cut-off", "context_len": 26}, "VERB": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 26, "context": "Logically with NOT gates , the input and the output swap , so if you input `` 1 '' it outputs as `` 0 '' ; likewise if you input `` 0 '' it outputs as `` 1 ''", "context_len": 39}}}, "hijackers": {"freq": 21, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 21, "word_index": 25, "context": "It is likely that because the pilots had been warned of the World Trade Center attacks and to beware of cockpit intrusion , when the hijackers attacked them , they purposely pressed on the talk button of the radio microphone , so sounds of the struggle in the cockpit will be heard by FAA ground controllers and by pilots of planes on the same radio frequency", "context_len": 66}}}, "overpowered": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "Soon after the flight took off , the hijackers entered the cockpit and overpowered the pilots", "context_len": 16}}}, "retake": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 40, "context": "In response to the Allied landings on Guadalcanal , the Japanese Imperial General Headquarters assigned the Imperial Japanese Army 's ( IJA ) 17th Army at Rabaul and under the command of Lieutenant General Harukichi Hyakutake , was ordered to retake Guadalcanal", "context_len": 42}}}, "hijacker": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 7, "context": "At this moment , it recorded a hijacker \u2019 s voice , thought to be Jarrah , speaking with a halting command of accented English and breathing and panting heavily , apparently from exertion , perhaps from a struggle , `` Ladies and gentlemen : here the captain", "context_len": 48}}}, "suspicious": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 22, "context": "He was questioned by officials , who did not believe that he could support himself with only $ 2,800 cash , and suspicious that he intended to become an illegal immigrant because he was using a one-way ticket", "context_len": 38}}}, "dispatcher": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "Ed Ballinger , the United flight dispatcher , began sending text cockpit warnings to United Airlines flights at 09:19 , 17 minutes after he became aware of Flight 175 's impact", "context_len": 31}}}, "routine": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 19, "context": "At 09:27:25 , as the aircraft was crossing into eastern Ohio airspace , the flight crew responded to a routine radio call from a Cleveland air traffic controller , who told them to watch for another plane twelve miles away and two thousand feet above them", "context_len": 46}}}, "outta": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Nice clb ( climb ) outta EWR [ Newark Airport ]", "context_len": 11}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 75, "context": "The Prodigy , Akon , Sean Paul , Seeed , Mando Diao , The Roots , Redman , The Rasmus , Bushido , SINIK , Sido , Juli , Freundeskreis , EPMD , Samy Deluxe , The Sounds , TOK , Papoose , Gimma , Clueso , Dendemann , Sugarplum Fairy , Puppetmastaz , Karpatenhund , Bligg , Samurai , Liricas Analas , Triplenine , 6er Gascho , Griot , Cigi & amp ; Straight outta Mama , Famara", "context_len": 79}}}, "indicating": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 20, "context": "Though palm trees and desert scenery are seen in shots of the local region and town throughout the show , indicating a location in the Western United States , it is never revealed which state the show is set in ( except for Francis 's whereabouts in early seasons , such as his military school in Alabama and his job in Alaska )", "context_len": 63}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 24, "context": "[ A ] preoccupying belief that the world had changed in some way that other people were aware of , which he interpreted as indicating he was the subject of a film and living in a film set ( a fabricated world \u2019 )", "context_len": 44}}}, "hasty": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 31, "context": "At 09:26 , after the pilots twice checked in with a routine altitude and weather report to an air traffic controller at the FAA 's Cleveland Center , Dahl wrote a hasty , misspelled ACARS reply : `` Ed cofirm latest mssg plz-Jason ''", "context_len": 44}}}, "airspace": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 11, "context": "At 09:27:25 , as the aircraft was crossing into eastern Ohio airspace , the flight crew responded to a routine radio call from a Cleveland air traffic controller , who told them to watch for another plane twelve miles away and two thousand feet above them", "context_len": 46}}}, "hijacking": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 5, "context": "He personally participated in the hijacking of American Airlines Flight 11 , the first plane to crash into the World Trade Center during the September 11 , 2001 attacks", "context_len": 29}, "VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "Aircraft hijacking", "context_len": 2}}}, "commandeer": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "The hijackers on those flights had waited no more than thirty minutes to commandeer the aircraft , most likely striking after the seat belt sign had been turned off and cabin service had begun", "context_len": 34}}}, "sprang": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 17, "context": "According to reports from passengers and crew , the hijackers tied red bandanas around their heads and sprang from their seats", "context_len": 21}}}, "cruised": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "At 9:28:05 , as the flight cruised at 35,000 feet over eastern Ohio , the plane abruptly dropped 685 feet", "context_len": 20}}}, "abruptly": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 16, "context": "At 9:28:05 , as the flight cruised at 35,000 feet over eastern Ohio , the plane abruptly dropped 685 feet", "context_len": 20}}}, "raspy": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 29, "context": "At 09:28:17 , eleven seconds into the descent , Cleveland heard a man scream into the cockpit radio : `` Mayday ! Mayday ! Mayday ! '' A second raspy shout went , `` Hey ! Get out of here ! '' Cleveland Air Traffic Controller John Werth did n't know the source of the call he heard , and could only make out what he heard as `` just some gruttural , gruttural sounds", "context_len": 75}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "She has a raspy voice", "context_len": 5}}}, "screams": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 29, "context": "`` He responded , `` Somebody call Cleveland ? `` , before he noticed Flight 93 's rapid descent and heard at 09:28:50 another transmission from the cockpit , screams alongside an even more desperate and garbled refrain : `` Hey ! Get out of here ! Get out of here ! '' The commission made no conclusion as to whether it was Dahl or co-pilot LeRoy Homer giving the distress call , but when Melody Homer and Sandy Dahl , Jason Dahl 's wife , together listened to the tape , Melody Homer claimed to have recognised her husband \u2019 s voice as the man who was shouting", "context_len": 109}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 18, "context": "Pinocchio denies that the story is true , but when Shrek shows him a Real Cricket , he screams and runs out", "context_len": 22}, "NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "In the end Miles screams : Peter Quint ! You devil ! and then dies", "context_len": 15}}}, "desperate": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 34, "context": "`` He responded , `` Somebody call Cleveland ? `` , before he noticed Flight 93 's rapid descent and heard at 09:28:50 another transmission from the cockpit , screams alongside an even more desperate and garbled refrain : `` Hey ! Get out of here ! Get out of here ! '' The commission made no conclusion as to whether it was Dahl or co-pilot LeRoy Homer giving the distress call , but when Melody Homer and Sandy Dahl , Jason Dahl 's wife , together listened to the tape , Melody Homer claimed to have recognised her husband \u2019 s voice as the man who was shouting", "context_len": 109}}}, "garbled": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 36, "context": "`` He responded , `` Somebody call Cleveland ? `` , before he noticed Flight 93 's rapid descent and heard at 09:28:50 another transmission from the cockpit , screams alongside an even more desperate and garbled refrain : `` Hey ! Get out of here ! Get out of here ! '' The commission made no conclusion as to whether it was Dahl or co-pilot LeRoy Homer giving the distress call , but when Melody Homer and Sandy Dahl , Jason Dahl 's wife , together listened to the tape , Melody Homer claimed to have recognised her husband \u2019 s voice as the man who was shouting", "context_len": 109}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "When the characters do speak , their words are severely garbled", "context_len": 11}}}, "refrain": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 37, "context": "`` He responded , `` Somebody call Cleveland ? `` , before he noticed Flight 93 's rapid descent and heard at 09:28:50 another transmission from the cockpit , screams alongside an even more desperate and garbled refrain : `` Hey ! Get out of here ! Get out of here ! '' The commission made no conclusion as to whether it