arious types of capture devices known as Pok\u00e9 Balls ) , train , battle , collect , and trade with each other", "context_len": 34}}}, "basics": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "It has a big difference from the other games but its basics are the same", "context_len": 15}}}, "knocks": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "`` After one player knocks out an opponent 's card , the defeater takes just one face-down prize card for non-EX Pok\u00e9mon", "context_len": 22}}}, "defeater": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "`` After one player knocks out an opponent 's card , the defeater takes just one face-down prize card for non-EX Pok\u00e9mon", "context_len": 22}}}, "fainted": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "There is one discard pile for each player , where fainted Pok\u00e9mon go", "context_len": 13}, "VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 24, "context": "They often thought this was happening when a person seemed to be mad , or when they had a fit , or when they fainted", "context_len": 25}}}, "flashing": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 37, "context": "It has two evolved forms , Porygon2 and Porygon-Z , and neither of them have appeared in the anime at all , even though it was Ash Ketchum 's Pikachu that made the explosion that caused the flashing lights", "context_len": 39}}}, "epileptic": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "This caused 685 Japanese children to have epileptic seizures", "context_len": 9}}}, "seizures": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 8, "context": "This caused 685 Japanese children to have epileptic seizures", "context_len": 9}}}, "toned": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "Also , the previous episodes released had been toned down when Pokemon aired again", "context_len": 14}}}, "blackface": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 16, "context": "Jynx , a species of Pok\u00e9mon , was criticized because it looked like it was using blackface ( an old film-making technique that makes white actors look African-American )", "context_len": 29}}}, "sprite": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "In `` Pok\u00e9mon Diamond and Pearl '' , the Pok\u00e9mon Registeel had its sprite changed in some European versions , because its pose was too similar to a Nazi salute", "context_len": 30}}}, "rookie": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 45, "context": "With just under 4 minutes to play in the first quarter , Green put his shoulder low to the knees of 315-pound Houston defensive tackle Travis Johnson in a successful attempt to block him on a play that started with a fumbled handoff to Dolphins rookie wide receiver Ted Ginn Jr", "context_len": 51}}}, "culprit": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 28, "context": "The series is a visual novel style courtroom drama where a rookie defense attorney must get their falsely accused client a not guilty verdict and find the true culprit", "context_len": 29}}}, "chan": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 16, "context": "In 1990 to 2007 , the manga was published in the magazine Giga & amp ; chan ( Shan )", "context_len": 20}}}, "hamster": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 6, "context": "this story is about a housekeeper hamster named Ebichu and her master , Gosujinjama , who she calls Office Lady ( OL )", "context_len": 23}}}, "tact": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "She often does not have any tact", "context_len": 7}}}, "kernel": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 20, "context": "In May 2004 Kenneth Brown of the Alexis de Tocqueville Institution raised the accusation that major parts of the Linux kernel had been copied from MINIX , in a book called `` S