n , and that no incidental , spontaneous , or chance cause can be prior to a proper , real , or underlying cause `` per se ''", "context_len": 79}}}, "causation": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 51, "context": "It is also essential that ontological causality does not suggest the temporal relation of before and after - between the cause and the effect ; that spontaneity ( in nature ) and chance ( in the sphere of moral actions ) are among the causes of effects belonging to the efficient causation , and that no incidental , spontaneous , or chance cause can be prior to a proper , real , or underlying cause `` per se ''", "context_len": 79}}}, "incidental": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 56, "context": "It is also essential that ontological causality does not suggest the temporal relation of before and after - between the cause and the effect ; that spontaneity ( in nature ) and chance ( in the sphere of moral actions ) are among the causes of effects belonging to the efficient causation , and that no incidental , spontaneous , or chance cause can be prior to a proper , real , or underlying cause `` per se ''", "context_len": 79}, "UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 6, "context": "Best known for the theme and incidental music to the `` Inspector Morse '' , for which he was nominated for 'Best Original Television Music ' at the British Academy Television Awards in 1991 , the sequel `` Lewis '' , and the prequel `` Endeavour ''", "context_len": 47}}}, "spontaneous": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 58, "context": "It is also essential that ontological causality does not suggest the temporal relation of before and after - between the cause and the effect ; that spontaneity ( in nature ) and chance ( in the sphere of moral actions ) are among the causes of effects belonging to the efficient causation , and that no incidental , spontaneous , or chance cause can be prior to a proper , real , or underlying cause `` per se ''", "context_len": 79}}}, "restricting": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 47, "context": "All investigations of causality coming later in history will consist in imposing a favorite hierarchy on the order ( priority ) of causes ; such as `` final & gt ; efficient & gt ; material & gt ; formal '' ( Aquinas ) , or in restricting all causality to the material and efficient causes or , to the efficient causality ( deterministic or chance ) , or just to regular sequences and correlations of natural phenomena ( the natural sciences describing `` how '' things happen rather than asking `` why '' they happen )", "context_len": 97}}}, "deterministic": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 63, "context": "All investigations of causality coming later in history will consist in imposing a favorite hierarchy on the order ( priority ) of causes ; such as `` final & gt ; efficient & gt ; material & gt ; formal '' ( Aquinas ) , or in restricting all causality to the material and efficient causes or , to the efficient causality ( deterministic or chance ) , or just to regular sequences and correlations of natural phenomena ( the natural sciences describing `` how '' things happen rather than asking `` why '' they happen )", "context_len": 97}}}, "accustomed": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 22, "context": "Hume says that if someone is used to always seeing the same things occur in the same order , he will get accustomed to them being in that order", "context_len": 29}}}, "zip": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "With `` 9658 '' , Wildhaus has the highest zip code in Switzerland", "context_len": 13}}}, "johann": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Johann", "context_len": 1}}}, "pious": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 27, "context": "Servant of God is a title given to individuals by different religions , but in general th