ria after they have taken them in", "context_len": 20}}}, "inexcusable": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 39, "context": "`` Texans head coach Gary Kubiak , while in some ways siding with Johnson in saying that NFL officials should review the rules on `` chop '' blocks , also called Johnson 's reaction over a fallen player `` inexcusable", "context_len": 40}}}, "sportswriters": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "While many fans and sportswriters alike called for Green to retire , Green was back with the team in practice , albeit in street clothes , the Friday after the injury after returning from Kansas City where he was evaluated by the same medical team that made the diagnosis in 2006", "context_len": 51}}}, "albeit": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 21, "context": "While many fans and sportswriters alike called for Green to retire , Green was back with the team in practice , albeit in street clothes , the Friday after the injury after returning from Kansas City where he was evaluated by the same medical team that made the diagnosis in 2006", "context_len": 51}}}, "rejoining": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "Louis Rams , rejoining the team he played for in 1999 and 2000", "context_len": 13}}}, "interception": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 1, "context": "An interception or intercept is a move in football that happens when a player on the defensive team catches a ball from the quarterback instead of the intended receiver", "context_len": 29}}}, "packing": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 5, "context": "A 17-year old Andy is packing for college and his toys , who have not been played with in a long time , feel forgotten and abandoned", "context_len": 27}}}, "intends": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "Andy decides to take Woody with him to college and intends