y she received while meeting the members of the U", "context_len": 22}}}, "etiquette": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 17, "context": "People of Chakswari like the vast majority of people of AJK are renowned for their hospitality , etiquette and hard work", "context_len": 21}}}, "kinship": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 13, "context": "He explained , `` I , on my part , feel a certain kinship with Korea , given the fact that it is recorded in the `` Chronicles of Japan '' that the mother of Emperor Kammu was of the line of King Muryong of Baekje", "context_len": 46}}}, "labyrinth": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "The old bazaar is actually very well maintained and a labyrinth of little streets with small outlets selling everything one can imagine", "context_len": 22}}}, "imagine": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 28, "context": "This means at least one unidentified set of remains is buried there so that the families of soldiers whose bodies were never brought back can go there , imagine it is their dead relative , and mourn", "context_len": 37}}}, "refurbished": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 20, "context": "The old town still has some iconic restuarants like the iconic old Roopyal dining restaurant near the old bazaar recently refurbished to compete with some new establishments on the colony road but sadly the once Kalyal hotel is no more with time came its demise", "context_len": 45}}}, "establishments": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 26, "context": "The old town still has some iconic restuarants like the iconic old Roopyal dining restaurant near the old bazaar recently refurbished to compete with some new establishments on the colony road but sadly the once Kalyal hotel is no more with time came its demise", "context_len": 45}}}, "outwards": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 5, "context"