, and occurs when its final metabolite , uric acid , crystallizes in the form of monosodium urate", "context_len": 25}}}, "metabolism": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 6, "context": "Gout is a disorder of purine metabolism , and occurs when its final metabolite , uric acid , crystallizes in the form of monosodium urate", "context_len": 25}}}, "metabolite": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "Gout is a disorder of purine metabolism , and occurs when its final metabolite , uric acid , crystallizes in the form of monosodium urate", "context_len": 25}}}, "crystallize": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "While it may crystallize at normal levels , it is more likely to do so as uric acid levels increase", "context_len": 20}}}, "triggering": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "Other factors believed to be important in triggering an acute episode of arthritis include cool temperatures , rapid changes in uric acid levels , acidosis , articular hydration , and extracellular matrixproteins , such as proteoglycans , collagens , and chondroitin sulfate", "context_len": 42}}}, "acidosis": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 24, "context": "Other factors believed to be important in triggering an acute episode of arthritis include cool temperatures , rapid changes in uric acid levels , acidosis , articular hydration , and extracellular matrixproteins , such as proteoglycans , collagens , and chondroitin sulfate", "context_len": 42}}}, "articular": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 26, "context": "Other factors believed to be important in triggering an acute episode of arthritis include cool temperatures , rapid changes in uric acid levels , acidosis , articular hydration , and extracellular matrixproteins , such as proteoglycans , collagens , and chondroitin sulfate", "context_len": 42}}}, "hydration": {"freq": 1, "P