 in electrolytes", "context_len": 6}}}, "erythrocyte": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 17, "context": "Other blood tests commonly performed are white blood cell count , electrolytes , renal function , and erythrocyte sedimentation rate ( ESR )", "context_len": 23}}}, "sedimentation": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 18, "context": "Other blood tests commonly performed are white blood cell count , electrolytes , renal function , and erythrocyte sedimentation rate ( ESR )", "context_len": 23}}}, "basal": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 3, "context": "Its mixture of basal fish and derived tetrapod characteristics led one of its discoverers , Neil Shubin , to call `` Tiktaalik '' a 'fishapod '", "context_len": 26}, "UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 3, "context": "It was more basal than other , better-known , members of its family , such as `` Mononykus '' and `` Shuvuuia ''", "context_len": 23}}}, "prevention": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 15, "context": "Dayana is concerned about humanitarian issues , such as AIDS awareness , and domestic violence prevention", "context_len": 16}}}, "purines": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "Gout may be secondary to sleep apnea through the release of purines from oxygen-starved cells", "context_len": 15}}}, "nonsteroidal": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Options for immediate treatment include nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs ( NSAIDs ) , colchicine and steroids", "context_len": 15}}}, "ibuprofen": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 11, "context": "While indomethacin has historically been the most commonly used NSAID , ibuprofen may be preferred due to its lack of side effects", "context_len": 22}}}, "proton": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 1, "context": "A proton pump inhibitor may be given to people at risk of experiencing gastric side effects", "context_len": 16}}}, "inhibitor": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 16, "context": "A number of medications are useful for preventing further episodes of gout , including xanthine oxidase inhibitor ( including allopurinol and febuxostat ) , and uricosurics ( including probenecid and sulfinpyrazone )", "context_len": 32}}}, "gastric": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "A proton pump inhibitor may be given to people at risk of experiencing gastric side effects", "context_len": 16}}}, "dose": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 8, "context": "The occurrence of gastrointestinal upset depends on the dose", "context_len": 9}}}, "doses": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 17, "context": "The risk of experiencing this side effect can be reduced by using smaller , yet still effective doses", "context_len": 18}}}, "erythromycin": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "Colchicine may interact with other commonly prescribed drugs such as atorvastatin and erythromycin", "context_len": 13}}}, "worsens": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 9, "context": "Some children continue to receive SSI if their disability worsens , or if they continue to develop more disabilities", "context_len": 19}}}, "intolerant": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "It will be a treatment option for the 3 % of people who are intolerant to other medications", "context_len": 18}}}, "intravenous": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 5, "context": "Pegloticase is administered as an intravenous infusion every two weeks and has been found to reduce uric acid levels in these people", "context_len": 22}}}, "prophylaxis": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Prophylaxis", "context_len": 1}}}, "xanthine": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 14, "context": 