 '' ; Japanese : , `` Reishotai '' ; ) is an archaic style of Chinese calligraphy", "context_len": 26}}}, "virtuous": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 14, "context": "As an Anglican clergyman , Malthus saw this situation as divinely imposed to teach virtuous behaviour", "context_len": 16}}}, "piety": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "He was content to guide boys on the path of piety and moral virtue rather than business success", "context_len": 18}}}, "stereotypical": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "Alger 's books are filled with stereotypical characters and dramatic highpoints ( setpieces ) played over and over again in book after book", "context_len": 23}}}, "unfeeling": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "Other setpieces include the cold , unfeeling lawyer threatening the young hero and his widowed mother with foreclosure ( another setpiece taken from Alger 's childhood ) , and the brutal poorhouse staff making the young hero 's life miserable while he dwells under their roof", "context_len": 46}}}, "poorhouse": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 31, "context": "Other setpieces include the cold , unfeeling lawyer threatening the young hero and his widowed mother with foreclosure ( another setpiece taken from Alger 's childhood ) , and the brutal poorhouse staff making the young hero 's life miserable while he dwells under their roof", "context_len": 46}}}, "dwells": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 42, "context": "Other setpieces include the cold , unfeeling lawyer threatening the young hero and his widowed mother with foreclosure ( another setpiece taken from Alger 's childhood ) , and the brutal poorhouse staff making the young hero 's life miserable while he dwells under their roof", "context_len": 46}}}, "satirists": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "Alger