hiness", "context_len": 20}}}, "neurologist": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 5, "context": "In a review , clinical neurologist Sebastian Dieguez said the book is `` painstakingly redundant , astoundingly arrogant in its claims and intents ''", "context_len": 24}}}, "widower": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 2, "context": "Selena 's widower Chris Perez joined both of the bands but left in 2010 to start his own band with Joe Ojeda , originally a keyboardist from Selena y Los Dinos", "context_len": 31}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "Lele Martini is a doctor and a widower with three children : Maria , Francesco `` Ciccio '' and Anna `` Annuccia ''", "context_len": 23}}}, "chimes": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "Wind chimes", "context_len": 2}, "NOUN_P": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 1, "context": "Wind chimes , usually of bronze , were used in ancient Rome , India , and China", "context_len": 17}}}, "improvise": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "A singer would improvise ( make up ) a solo using nonsense syllables which is like a musical instrument solo in a song", "context_len": 23}}}, "cooke": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Cooke", "context_len": 1}}}, "backlog": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 20, "context": "They hoped that regular programs of research and education would improve the efficiency of the federal courts and relieve the backlog of cases in the lower courts", "context_len": 27}}}, "caseloads": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 39, "context": "In the 1950s and early 1960s , the Judicial Conference and the Administrative Office commissioned research projects to examine problems of judicial administration at the same time that they organized educational programs to help judges manage growing and complicated caseloads", "context_len": 40}}}, "i