l Center Foundation , solicits support for the Center", "context_len": 15}}}, "padlocks": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 17, "context": "This type of lock is popular on safes and doors , but is almost never seen on padlocks", "context_len": 18}}}, "hasps": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "Master Lock 's products include padlocks , door locks , and lock hasps", "context_len": 13}}}, "caliber": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "30 caliber rifle", "context_len": 3}}}, "alexander": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 0, "context": "Alexander the Great visited the town and named it after himself", "context_len": 11}}}, "whispers": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "The Doctor learns that he will trust her in the future when she whispers his real name into his ear", "context_len": 20}}}, "screwdriver": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "He does this by using a sonic screwdriver that she was given by himself in his future ( her past )", "context_len": 21}}}, "pretends": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 13, "context": "She says she is married , and answers yes to a question she pretends think is him asking her to marry him", "context_len": 22}, "NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "Some years later a young monk escapes from his monastery and pretends to be the murdered son of Ivan the Terrible", "context_len": 21}}}, "regenerating": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 1, "context": "After regenerating in New York , Melody became Rory and Amy 's childhood friend Mels ( Maya Glace-Green ) and grew up alongside them", "context_len": 24}}}, "kidnaped": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "Baby Melody is kidnaped by Madame Kovarian ( Frances Barber ) to become a weapon against the Doctor", "