, "word_index": 6, "context": "On at least one occasion he dyed his hair black and , while it was wet , he wore a teacosy on his head", "context_len": 24}}}, "notebooks": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "He wrote a lot of ideas in his notebooks , but he did not think these ideas were ready for publication , yet they turned out to be very important", "context_len": 30}}}, "ionized": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "In 1923 it was indeed discovered that there were complex , ionized layers ( called the ionosphere )", "context_len": 18}, "VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "They are charged ( ionized ) atoms from the solar corona , and fields , in particular magnetic fields", "context_len": 19}}}, "echoes": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "He studied reflection in telephone circuits ( these produced disturbing echoes )", "context_len": 12}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "says that the intended pronunciation deliberately echoes the American peanut butter brand Jif , and CompuServe employees would often say `` Choosy developers choose GIF '' , spoofing this brand 's television commercials", "context_len": 33}}}, "quotation": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 3, "context": "A sentence , quotation , or poem that is put at the beginning of a written work", "context_len": 17}}}, "tango": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Argentine rock music has the tango and Argentine folk music", "context_len": 10}}}, "emerge": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "However , in the 1980s popular rock bands in Armenia began to emerge", "context_len": 13}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 27, "context": "In `` What pragmatism means '' , James writes that the central point of his own doctrine of truth is , in brief , that `` Truths emerge from facts , but 