ponent decays or grows , and how fast it grows is entirely a function of its wave number ( a measure of how many peaks and troughs per centimeter ) and the radii of the original cylindrical stream", "context_len": 40}}}, "multidisciplinary": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "It is a multidisciplinary field of research and draws on environmental chemistry , physics , meteorology , computer modeling , oceanography , geology and volcanology and other disciplines", "context_len": 28}}}, "oceanography": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 20, "context": "It is a multidisciplinary field of research and draws on environmental chemistry , physics , meteorology , computer modeling , oceanography , geology and volcanology and other disciplines", "context_len": 28}}}, "volcanology": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 24, "context": "It is a multidisciplinary field of research and draws on environmental chemistry , physics , meteorology , computer modeling , oceanography , geology and volcanology and other disciplines", "context_len": 28}}}, "climatology": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "Research is connected with other areas of study such as climatology", "context_len": 11}}}, "bombardment": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 20, "context": "The composition of the Earth 's atmosphere changes as result of natural processes such as volcano emissions , lightning and bombardment by solar particles from the Sun 's corona", "context_len": 29}}}, "ozone": {"freq": 16, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 15, "word_index": 17, "context": "Two important examples of this were the explanation by Sydney Chapman and Gordon Dobson of how the ozone layer is created and maintained , and the explanation of photochemical smog by Arie Jan Haagen-Smit", "context_len": 34}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "Older chlorine based refrigerants such as R22 have been phased out due to ozone depletion", "context_len": 15}}}, "depletion": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 8, "context": "Examples of problems include acid rain , ozone depletion , photochemical smog , greenhouse gases and global warming", "context_len": 18}}}, "photochemical": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 28, "context": "Two important examples of this were the explanation by Sydney Chapman and Gordon Dobson of how the ozone layer is created and maintained , and the explanation of photochemical smog by Arie Jan Haagen-Smit", "context_len": 34}}}, "smog": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 29, "context": "Two important examples of this were the explanation by Sydney Chapman and Gordon Dobson of how the ozone layer is created and maintained , and the explanation of photochemical smog by Arie Jan Haagen-Smit", "context_len": 34}}}, "geosphere": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 22, "context": "Now , scientists study atmospheric chemistry as one part of a single system with the rest of the atmosphere , biosphere and geosphere", "context_len": 23}}}, "aerosol": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 15, "context": "Some surface based instruments such as LIDAR can provide concentration profiles of chemical compounds and aerosol but are still restricted in the horizontal region they cover", "context_len": 26}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 42, "context": "It is also used to make various other chemicals containing fluorine , such as teflon ( the coating in a frying pan ) , freon ( the cooling agent in an air conditioner ) , and fluorocarbons ( used as propellants in aerosol cans )", "context_len": 45}}}, "sinks": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "Measurements made in the laboratory are essential to our understanding of the sources and sinks of pollutants and compounds found in nature", "context_len": 22}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 2, "context": "He then sinks back in a chair", "context_len": 7}}}, "photochemistry": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "Scientists also study photochemistry which quantifies how quickly molecules are split apart by sunlight and what the products are", "context_len": 19}}}, "quantifies": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Scientists also study photochemistry which quantifies how quickly molecules are split apart by sunlight and what the products are", "context_len": 19}}}, "kamikaze": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "But the main force was destroyed by a typhoon which was later called `` kamikaze ''", "context_len": 16}}}, "lithographic": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 15, "context": "At the age of sixteen , Maurer quit school to work at his father 's lithographic firm", "context_len": 17}}}, "sharply": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 13, "context": "At the age of thirty-six , in Paris , Maurer changed his methods sharply", "context_len": 14}}}, "fauvist": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "From that point on he painted only in the cubist and fauvist manner", "context_len": 13}}}, "garret": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "For the next 17 years , Maurer painted in a garret in his father 's house , and gained no critical acclaim", "context_len": 22}}}, "famed": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "Also among Virgin Interactive alumni are famed video game composer Tommy Tallarico , artist Doug TenNapel , designer David Bishop , animator Bill Kroyer , animator artists Andy Luckey and Mike Dietz and programmer Andy Astor", "context_len": 36}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "The task was given to Mike Hall , who design the famed DFV and BDA engines", "context_len": 16}}}, "compositional": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 21, "context": "He is one of the most prolific television and movie composers in the UK , known for his wide range of compositional genres", "context_len": 23}}}, "concluding": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "In 2009 he composed the music for `` 1983 '' , the concluding episode of the acclaimed Channel 4 drama series `` Red Riding ''", "context_len": 25}}}, "surprising": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "Manieerre 's work been called `` surprising and prophetic ''", "context_len": 10}}}, "embarking": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 32, "context": "He made his way across England to France , south through Germany , across Switzerland to Italy , back north for a second stay in Paris , and around northern Germany before embarking from Bremerhaven in late-November", "context_len": 37}}}, "rudimentary": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 24, "context": "Summers spent at the family \u2019 s retreat in Mason Country , Michigan were his most productive periods during his early career and provided rudimentary knowledge of growing and marketing fruit", "context_len": 31}}}, "scraps": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 18, "context": "Living in rural Michigan and struggling financially he made art from what was available ( Portland cement , scraps of lumber , pieces of plywood )", "context_len": 26}}}, "freestanding": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 19, "context": "Sheets of composite wood ( brand names Novoply and Timblend ) were laminated together for thickness and carved into freestanding sculptures", "context_len": 21}}}, "abstracts": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 21, "context": "In recent years it has become clear that Manierre Dawson was probably slightly ahead of Dove and Kandinsky in producing pure abstracts", "context_len": 22}}}, "leaseback": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 7, "context": "He was the first person to apply leaseback financing to things other than automobiles", "context_len": 14}}}, "polk": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Polk", "context_len": 1}}}, "shipper": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "His great-great-great-grandfather James Carey was an 18th- and 19th-century Baltimore shipper , the chairman of the Bank of Maryland , a member of Baltimore 's first City council , and a relative of Johns Hopkins", "context_len": 35}}}, "repay": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "He then worked at his stepfather 's car dealership to repay his college expenses", "context_len": 14}}}, "benefactor": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "Carey was a benefactor to the Arizona State University College of Business", "context_len": 12}}}, "trustee": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "He was a trustee emeritus at the school and donated the money through his W", "context_len": 15}}}, "endowment": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 44, "context": "At the same time , OU developed a separate legislative proposal ( the `` New Partnership '' ) to start a separate 15-person board of trustees for OU and a $ 800 million state bond issue to match private donations to a new OU endowment fund", "context_len": 46}}}, "infinitesimals": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 8, "context": "But in 1960 , Abraham Robinson found that infinitesimals also provide a rigorous basis for the calculus", "context_len": 17}}}, "salient": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "It was an excellent Observation post to see the salient", "context_len": 10}}}, "chlorine": {"freq": 21, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 20, "word_index": 20, "context": "It is also made when manganese ( IV ) oxide is reacted with hydrochloric acid ; this reaction also produces chlorine", "context_len": 21}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "The chlorine part of CFC refrigerants can reduce ozone", "context_len": 9}}}, "cylinders": {"freq": 14, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 14, "word_index": 14, "context": "Before the second battle at Ypres , the Germans had placed 5,700 chlorine gas cylinders in front of their trenches", "context_len": 20}}}, "towel": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 10, "context": "Shocked by what she sees , she accidentally drops her towel , revealing her bare tattooed buttocks ( as well as everything else her breasts , abdomen , and crotch , which are off-screen ) to the passing police car , whose driver pulls over , startled away by the screaming and naked woman", "context_len": 54}}}, "commonwealths": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "commonwealths and territories , five in U", "context_len": 7}}}, "academia": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 0, "context": "Academia", "context_len": 1}}}, "bono": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 16, "context": "Additionally , 20-30 % of the ongoing work in his office is dedicated to `` pro bono '' or at-cost work for not-for-profits , totaling over 50 projects for over 30 organizations over the last 25 years", "context_len": 37}}}, "skepticism": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 23, "context": "In this capacity , he met Martin Luther King and other leaders of the Civil Rights Movement , after winning over their initial skepticism of being a government attorney", "context_len": 29}}}, "snaring": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 18, "context": "In the late 1980s , Henderson presided over a long-running case over the fishing industry 's practice of snaring dolphins in its tuna nets", "context_len": 24}}}, "loosen": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 17, "context": "also rejected attempts by the Clinton and Bush administrations to relax legal standards on fishing practices and loosen dolphin safe labeling on tuna", "context_len": 23}}}, "oversight": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 6, "context": "They do not need the legal oversight of local councils , which usually act as the local planning authority for such developments", "context_len": 22}}}, "interrogated": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "While there he was briefly detained and interrogated by white policemen", "context_len": 11}}}, "professionalism": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "In the years before professionalism was allowed in athletics , this kind of full-time training was unusual", "context_len": 17}}}, "spokesmen": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "Jenner is one of only seven Wheaties `` spokesmen", "context_len": 9}}}, "infomercial": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "In the early 1990s , she was the host of an infomercial for a stair-climbing exercise machine called the `` Stair Climber Plus ''", "context_len": 24}}}, "skated": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "She skated with Tai Babilonia for `` Skating with Celebrities '' in January\u2013March 2006", "context_len": 14}}}, "stepdaughters": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "She is on the series with her wife Kris Jenner , stepdaughters Kourtney , Kim , Khlo\u00e9 , and stepson Rob Kardashian and daughters Kylie and Kendall Jenner", "context_len": 28}}}, "motivational": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 14, "context": "This was after she retired from sports , built a successful career as a motivational speaker and television sports commentator", "context_len": 20}}}, "contemplating": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "In July 2017 , Jenner announced that she was contemplating running in the 2018 race for the US Senate to represent California", "context_len": 22}}}, "sponsorships": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 6, "context": "It gives out various awards and sponsorships to promising mathematicians", "context_len": 10}}}, "postdoctoral": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "The Clay Institute also does other things , including a postdoctoral program ( ten Clay Research Fellows are supported each year ) and an annual summer school , the proceedings of which are published jointly with the American Mathematical Society", "context_len": 40}}}, "integrates": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 13, "context": "The Zune Marketplace was an online music , video and podcast store that integrates with Zune software , Zune devices , phones with Zune support , and Xbox 360", "context_len": 29}}}, "socialites": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 4, "context": "In history , many socialites were aristocrats who attended gatherings of other wealthy people", "context_len": 14}}}, "exert": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 2, "word_index": null, "context": null, "context_len": 0}}}, "torque": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 23, "context": "The magnetic moment of a magnet is a quantity that determines the force that the magnet can exert on electric currents and the torque that a magnetic field will exert on it", "context_len": 32}}}, "symmetric": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "The dipole component of an object 's magnetic field is symmetric about the direction of its magnetic dipole moment , and decreases as the inverse cube of the distance from the object", "context_len": 32}}}, "electrostatics": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 15, "context": "The North and South poles are an analogy