ing northeast", "context_len": 14}}}, "monolith": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "A single large monolith , high , stood in the centre along with an alignment of smaller stones", "context_len": 18}}}, "ploughed": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 1, "context": "A ploughed barrow is visible from the air in the northwestern quadrant", "context_len": 12}}}, "quadrant": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 11, "context": "A ploughed barrow is visible from the air in the northwestern quadrant", "context_len": 12}}}, "earthwork": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "A henge is a Neolithic earthwork", "context_len": 6}}}, "rampart": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 17, "context": "They are not thought to be primarily defensive , because their ditch is inside the wall or rampart", "context_len": 18}}}, "alignments": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 6, "context": "They include rows of stones ( alignments ) , dolmens , tumuli and single menhirs", "context_len": 15}}}, "tumuli": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 11, "context": "They include rows of stones ( alignments ) , dolmens , tumuli and single menhirs", "context_len": 15}}}, "menhirs": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 4, "context": "There are some individual menhirs and at least one other formation which do not fit into the above categories", "context_len": 19}}}, "ovens": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 26, "context": "In recent centuries , many of the sites have been neglected , with reports of dolmens being used as sheep shelters , chicken sheds or even ovens", "context_len": 27}}}, "cromlech": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": null, "context": null, "context_len": 0}}}, "recurs": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "This fan-like layout recurs a li